    "content": "Stop juggling tabs and subscriptions - AI Fiesta gives you access to all best-in-class AI models for just $12/month. That's almost half of what you'd pay for a single premium AI chat subscription. One Window. 9+ Perspectives. Achieve Optimal Efficiency. Every feature is designed to amplify your AI-powered productivity Compare All Premium AIs at Once Free AI models often deliver restricted and inferior answers. With AI Fiesta, you get access to multiple top‑tier premium models, all in one place. Compare their responses side‑by‑side to experience faster, smarter, and most accurate answers. Save hours of manual comparison Customize your AI team instantly Never miss the most accurate answer again Introducing Super Fiesta Super Fiesta is designed to automatically select the most suitable AI model for your query, delivering a seamless and efficient experience. It keeps context and maintains a consistent tone. Faster decisions via automatic best-model selection. Request alternatives without leaving the conversation. Unified context across models for a continuous dialogue. Games - Quick Mental Challenges Short, engaging games designed to sharpen focus, memory, and reasoning in just a few minutes a day. Build focus, memory, and problem-solving skills Track performance with clear progress metrics Compete on leaderboards or play just for yourself Generate Images & Transcribe Audio Bring your creative and content ideas to life instantly with AI-powered image generation and fast, accurate audio transcription - no extra tools needed. Generate high-quality images for any purpose. Get instant, clear transcripts from your recorded audio. Effortlessly edit outputs to meet specific project needs. Avatars - Build your Expert Team Introducing a brand-new feature: Avatars. With Avatars, you can choose who you want to interact with — whether it’s legendary figures from history or a team of dedicated expert advisors tailored to your personal needs. Engage with historical figures. Build a personalized expert team. Get tailored advice and insights. Custom Projects with System Instructions Create unique projects with tailored system guidelines. Set 'Marketing Mode' or 'Code Review Mode' once, ensuring every AI model follows your project's direction throughout. One-time setup keeps all AI replies on-brand and on-task. Instantly switch modes across chats Maintain consistent tone and rules without repetition. Get 9+ Premium AI Models for Half the Price of One 🔥 Limited time: Save 90% compared to individual subscriptions Individual AI Subscriptions $116+/month What you're paying now ChatGPT Plus GPT-5 $20/mo Google Gemini 2.5 Pro $20/mo Perplexity Pro $20/mo Claude Pro - Sonnet 4 $20/mo Grok 4 $30/mo Multiple subscriptions to manage - expensive Constant tab switching No comparison features Individual AI Subscriptions What you're paying now ChatGPT $20/mo Gemini $20/mo Perplexity $20/mo Claude $20/mo Grok $30/mo Multiple subscriptions to manage - expensive Constant tab switching No comparison features VS AI Fiesta /Month Monthly /Year + Quarterly Webinar Access Most popular Ultimate Promptbook Access All premium AI models & Super Fiesta Side-by-side comparison 3 million tokens/month (Premium models count as 4×) 🔒 Payments are processed by TagMango using Razorpay & Stripe By signing up you agree to receive verification emails, account updates and marketing communication related to AIFiesta. You can unsubscribe from marketing emails anytime. Read our Privacy Policy and Terms. How is AI Fiesta different from subscribing to each AI separately? AI Fiesta brings together the world’s most powerful AI models - Grok 4, ChatGPT 5, Gemini 2.5 Pro, DeepSeek, Claude Sonnet 4, Perplexity Sonar Pro, Kimi K2, Qwen 3 Max and Mistral - in one place. Instead of juggling multiple subscriptions and browser tabs, you get all answers side-by-side in a single chat window, plus exclusive features like Prompt Enhancer and Custom Projects. Can I choose which AI models to use? Yes! You can toggle AI models on or off at any time during your chat and turn them back on later without losing your chat history. Do I get unlimited messages? You get 3,000,000 tokens per month with your subscription. Each token is approximately ¾ of a word. For most users, this is far more than needed — the average usage is around 200,000 tokens per month. Standard models consume tokens at 1x rate whereas Premium models consume tokens at 4x rate. What happens if I run out of tokens? 3 million tokens is a very large allowance, and 99% of users never come close to exhausting it. You’ll see warnings before hitting zero.​ That said, if you reach that limit, please reach out to us at Support to get more tokens on paid basis. Do you offer refunds? All payments made to AI Fiesta are non-refundable, regardless of your usage during the subscription period. Once your subscription fee is charged, you will not be entitled to a refund for any unused services, unused tokens, or partial subscription periods. You may cancel your subscription at any time; however, cancellation will only prevent future billing charges and will not result in any refund for the current billing cycle. Refunds may be considered in the following exceptional circumstances: Billing errors Duplicate charges Other circumstances at our sole discretion Exceptions beyond the above may only be granted if required by applicable law. How can I manage or cancel my subscription? Log in to AI Fiesta, go to Settings, and select your subscription management option. Where can I access Promptbook? You can log in at promptbook.aifiesta.ai using your registered email. Please note: this feature is only available to paid users. Can I use AI Fiesta on my phone? Yes! You can use AI Fiesta in your mobile browser at chat.v2.aifiesta.ai or install our dedicated apps - Android and iOS - to access the platform anytime, anywhere. Will I get free upgrades when new AI versions are released? Yes! If ChatGPT releases Model 6 or