    "content": "Study for an ExamLearn a LanguageProduct KnowledgeCompliance Refresher Trusted by leading organisations 300K+ Courses created 180+ Countries 100+ Languages 4.7 Capterra rating Live Demo See AI Flashcards in Action. ‹ Rufous Hummingbird ↻ Victorian Koala ↻ Asiatic Lion ↻ Roars Heard 8 Kilometres Away A lion's roar hits 114 decibels and travels 8 km across open savanna. Each roar is acoustically unique, as individual as a fingerprint, used to coordinate the pride, signal territory, and occasionally just make a point. ↺ Silver Persian ↻ Greater Flamingo ↻ › Start Free Make flascards for any type of content Create engaging flashcards with AI for all type of usecases Turn safety policies and procedures into flashcards staff actually remember. Start Free ‹ PPE ↻ Hazard Signs ↻ Know the symbols Ensure you recognize all the symbols and what safety practices to follow in each scenario. ↺ Lifting ↻ › Bring your dishes to life Break down techniques and terminology for kitchen and hospitality teams. Start Free ‹ Knife Precision ↻ Heat Control ↻ Pan-Searing Cooking at high heat to quickly brown the surface and lock in moisture. ↺ Liquid Emulsion ↻ › Turn paintings into flipcards Make visual subjects like art history stick with image-led flashcards. Start Free ‹ Van Gogh ↻ Hokusai ↻ The Great Wave Hokusai's iconic Japanese woodblock print of a towering wave. ↺ Vermeer ↻ › Train for better retention Help reps master discovery, objections and closing at their own pace. Start Free ‹ Objections ↻ Qualifying ↻ Chase the right deals Check budget, authority, need and timeline before investing your time. ↺ Closing ↻ › Any format Turn any document into a flashcard set. Upload a PDF, drop in a PowerPoint, paste text or share a link — Coursebox reads your source and pulls out key terms and concepts to build a study-ready deck in seconds. PDF, PPT, DOC, TXT, CSV and more Web links, YouTube videos, and pasted text AI extracts key terms and concepts automatically No reformatting or manual input needed Built right in Use flashcards directly into your course Every course Coursebox generates comes with a flashcard deck built in. Based on your generation prompt and source files, AI automatically pulls out the key terms and concepts without the need for manual flash card creation. Multilingual Build flashcards in any language. Generate the same flashcard deck in over 100 languages. Whether you're teaching a language or training a global team, Coursebox handles translation and formatting automatically. 100+ languages supported Auto-translated content from any source Pronunciation guides for language learning One deck delivered to teams in every region What our users say Loved by trainers, teachers and course creators What I liked most about Coursebox is how easy it is to create and manage courses. The platform provides flexible tools for engaging learners and allows for designing interactive content quickly. The user interface is intuitive, making it simple to access all the features without any confusion. Abderrahim E Learning and Development Manager Start Free Frequently Asked Questions How fast can I create flashcards? Most decks are ready in seconds. Upload a file or paste text and Coursebox instantly generates a structured, study-ready set of cards. Can I edit flashcards generated by Coursebox? Flashcards can be edited after generation so you can refine wording, change colours, adjust difficulty, add images, and organise cards for your specific learning goals. Can I export or share flashcards created in Coursebox? Flashcards can be exported, shared via link, embedded in lessons or packaged as SCORM or LTI content for use in other learning platforms.",
