    "content": "It is easy to test out candidates based on the courses they do and to gauge their understanding, without me having to do it all manually. Lwando T Technical Mentor, Non-Profit Turn any topic or document into multiple choice, drag and drop or open answer quizzes in seconds. Every answer is graded instantly, with feedback that explains why. Trusted by leading organisations Try a live question generated by AI. This is exactly what your learners see — one question, four options, immediate right or wrong feedback. No setup, no marking. Type a topic, paste a URL or upload a document and Coursebox generates a ready-to-use quiz instantly. Every question is editable before you publish, so you stay in control. Coursebox AI grades written responses against your rubric, giving learners detailed feedback on short answer questions and long-form assignment submissions, going beyond instant grading on AI quizzes. Coursebox quizzes can be created and delivered in over 100 languages. AI translates questions, answer options, and feedback automatically — keeping assessment consistent across every region. Click a language to preview 4.7/5 based on 200+ reviews All generated questions can be reviewed and edited before publishing, so you can refine wording, adjust difficulty, or change answer options as needed. Coursebox auto-grades compatible question types, giving learners instant results and feedback after submission. Quizzes can be delivered inside Coursebox's own LMS, embedded into courses, or exported via SCORM or LTI for use in most major platforms. Quizzes can be created and delivered in over 100 languages, keeping assessment consistent across global teams. Sign up free and turn any topic or document into a quiz in seconds. No credit card required.",
