    "content": "See How AI Search Engines Mention Your Brand AI Search Watcher by Mangools shows you when and where your brand is mentioned in ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, and other AI search engines, so you can track visibility, protect your reputation, and spot new opportunities. Seen, cited and trusted in the AI space Own Your Visibility in the AI Era. Monitor your brand’s visibility in AI search Track how your brand shows up in ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Google AI Mode, Gemini, Claude, Grok, Mistral, and Llama. Each checkup runs multiple prompts for accurate, repeatable insights - so you always know exactly where you stand. Get tailored prompt ideas instantly Not sure what to ask? AI Search Watcher suggests brand-relevant prompts for you, or lets you add your own. Set up tracking in 30 seconds and uncover the questions your audience is really asking. Compare yourself to competitors Don’t just measure your own visibility. Get side-by-side reports showing how your competitors rank, where they’re cited, and how your presence stacks up across the major AI search engines. Understand how AI perceives your brand See how LLMs describe and interpret your brand. Uncover gaps, misperceptions, and opportunities to influence how AI explains your business to users. One Tool. Every AI Model That Shapes Search. \n      Best value for money? \n      You bet!\n     You bet! \n     Mangools Basic For solopreneurs, freelance SEOs and marketers. Mangools Premium For marketing teams and specialists. Mangools Agency For professional SEOs and marketing agencies. Frequently asked questions Answers to common questions about AI Search Watcher. If you have any other questions, please don't hesitate to contact us. \n                 What is AI Search Watcher and how does it work? AI Search Watcher is an LLM tracker developed by Mangools that monitors your brand’s visibility across AI search engines such as ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Gemini, etc. It runs each prompt multiple times and delivers accurate average positions, visibility scores, and citation insights for the most important prompts across multiple AI platforms. \n                 Which AI search engines and LLMs does AI Search Watcher support? We currently track the eight most popular AI search engines: ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Google AI Mode, Gemini, Claude, Grok, Mistral, and Llama. \n                 Why does AI Search Watcher run each prompt multiple times? Because AI search results aren’t always consistent. Running each prompt multiple times ensures accurate averages, reliable visibility scores, and more citation variants. \n                 Can I monitor my competitors on AI platforms? Yes, of course! AI Search Watcher lets you track competitor brands side by side with your own, so you can compare visibility, positions, and citations. \n                 What is the difference between AI search monitoring and SEO rank tracking? SEO rank tracking measures how your website ranks in Google’s search results, while AI search monitoring shows how AI search engines mention your brand in generated answers. Both are important, but they focus on different types of search engines. To track your website’s SEO performance in Google Search, try SERPWatcher - our free SEO rank tracking tool. \n                 Why do I need to optimize my website for AI search engines? LLMs like ChatGPT are changing how people discover information - creating a new way to promote your brand, website, products, and services online. If your brand isn’t cited in AI answers, you risk losing visibility and potential customers to competitors who are. \n                 How can AI Search Watcher boost my brand’s visibility in AI search engines? By showing you where and how your brand appears in AI answers, you can adjust your content and GEO strategy to get cited more often ahead of your competitors. \n                 What is Generative Engine Optimization (GEO)? GEO is the process of optimizing your brand and content to appear more frequently in generative AI search results from LLMs like ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, etc. For more information, make sure to check out our ultimate Generative Engine Optimization guide. Take Control of AI Search Know exactly when and where your brand is mentioned across ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, and every major AI search engine. Track My AI Visibility Start in 30 seconds. No credit card required.",
