gn up No hidden fees, all features are completely free, with no usage limits, and summaries can be generated online without logging in. Accurately Extract Key Points from Long Videos For 2-3 hour-long videos, manually watching and summarizing can easily miss key points. Use AI Video Summarizer to condense all the information in the video into a clear, concise outline with one click, while ensuring that the summary closely matches your video content, eliminating the need for manual verification. Extract Key Summary from Your Video >> Summarize Any Type of Video into Notes in One Click Easily upload your Zoom meeting recordings, instructional videos, or even YouTube links directly to AI Video Summarizer, any type of video can be turned into clear, structured summary notes, including key points and timestamps, ready for reuse and further editing, saving you a lot of time on organizing content. Summarize Any Type of Video for Free >> Turn Videos into Intuitive Mind Maps with AI Video Summarizer Beyond clear text summaries, you can take it a step further by turning videos into more intuitive and structured mind maps. Especially for students, using our AI video summarizing tool to organize complex or dull content into well-structured, hierarchical mind maps makes it much easier to understand and remember. Convert Video to Text Summary >> Customize Your Summary with 9 Different Video Summary Templates Unlike standard summary templates, AI Video Summarizer offers 9 customizable templates, each optimized for different types of video content. For example, finance videos can use the Financial Analysis template to extract key financial data and notes, while course videos can use the Course Summary template to capture complex theoretical explanations. This way, any type of video can be summarized and organized accurately. Customize Your Summary Online >> Get a full transcript and summary in seconds AI Video Summarizer generates clear summaries while also providing full transcripts, subtitles, and chapters for each video. For YouTube creators, the transcript can be easily edited for other platforms or translated into multiple languages to reach a wider audience. Summarize Video to Text >> How to Use AI Video Summarizer? Summarizing a video to text only takes three steps: upload your video file and click start. In just a few seconds, you'll get the full transcript and summary. 01 Upload your video Supports common video formats like MP4 and MOV, and even YouTube videos can be uploaded, as long as the file size is kept under 1GB. 02 Click to get started In less than 3 seconds after clicking the button, you can get not only the transcript and subtitles of your uploaded video, but also a detailed summary. 03 Further edit & summarize You can directly copy or further summarize with AI Video Summarizer, and turn the summary into a mind map for easier understanding. User Reviews of AI Video Summarizer I initially thought this AI video summarizing tool would be useless, but AI Video Summarizer completely exceeded my expectations. The summaries are highly accurate, and I can use them directly with little to no editing. David Kim Student I uploaded my recorded course, and the structured outline and subtitles generated by AI Video Summarizer generated made it much easier for students to learn. They can clearly see and jump to any chapter they want to study. Rachel Brown Online Course Creator I rely on AI Video Summarizer to summarize videos into notes. I upload interview content and quickly get a clear, concise summary, which is more than ten times faster than writing it manually. Michael Lee Journalist AI Video Summarizer FAQs Have any questions or feedback about summarizing video to text? Feel free to contact us via email.",
