nd performance are finally solved.\" Specialized Solutions Aimey comes pre-trained with strategies for specific verticals and business types. Location Marketing For businesses that rely on local customers. Dominate \"Near Me\" searches, drive foot traffic, and capture emergency intent. We optimize for phone calls, map directions, and local bookings. Industry Solutions Lead Generation For high-ticket service providers. We optimize for lead quality and lower Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC) for competitive B2C industries. We train Google's AI to find your ideal clients. Industry Solutions Ecommerce For online retailers. Stop burning budget on vanity metrics. We focus purely on ROAS and Profit, optimizing your product feed and shopping campaigns to find shoppers ready to buy now. Industry Solutions Smart Growth. Zero Commission on Your First €1,000. Pay for the platform, get performance for free. No hidden fees, just pure ROI. Standard Access For businesses ready to automate and scale. Includes management of your first €1,000 in monthly spend. Start Free 7-Day Trial Commission Structure Monthly Spend Commission Up to €1,000 Included (0%) €1,001 - €20,000 6% €20,001+ 3% *Progressive commission applies only to spend exceeding the included €1,000 threshold. Custom For large agencies & franchises. Tailored pricing for volume. Frequently Asked Questions Product & Technical Focus Is Aimey a \"Black Box\" automation tool? How does the AI Keyword Research work? Can I use Aimey for other platforms like Facebook? Is my data safe with Aimey? What happens if I cancel? Ready to Automate Your Google Ads Success? Join the businesses using AI PPC Agents to lower costs and increase sales. 7-Day Free Trial. No Commitment.",
