unding speech in 20+ expressive voices. Add mood tags (whisper, excitement, slow) right inside the prompt. Agents can narrate reports, produce voiceovers, and deliver audio files without leaving the chat. Browser Use Give your agents a real browser. They log in to services on your behalf, navigate UIs, fill forms, and extract live data, with stealth rendering, persistent session profiles, and automatic CAPTCHA solving. A week of work, by Tuesday. Every agent run shaves minutes off real work. Across schedules, that's hours per week. Across teammates, that's a team operating at 10× capacity. Every new hire compounds the leverage. The bar only goes up. Every agent run and every chat is scored, and the signal feeds back into how the platform runs. Quality climbs week over week. 95%+ high-quality today, and still rising. Always at the frontier. Pick the model that fits: OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, MiniMax. Every new frontier release lands in CREAO on day one. Start free. Scale when ready. Pick what fits. Change any time. Notes from the frontier. What we learn building agents. Field notes for the work in front of you. Great work shouldn't end when an agent finishes. CREAO builds the loop : every run feeds back, every result sharpens the next, and your practice compounds.",
