ion Apple devices. Applebot-Extended split for Apple Intelligence training opt. OpenAI training-crawler accessibility. Cloudflare AI Audit, WAF interference, SSR reachability, independence from search bot. ChatGPT Search citation eligibility. Separately controllable from GPTBot training. Catches bundled blocking by Cloudflare AI Audit. Anthropic's three-bot fleet: training, user-initiated, search. All honor robots.txt independently; sites routinely block one and not the others. Perplexity citation reach. Two bots (PerplexityBot respects robots, Perplexity-User does not) plus Cloudflare's August 2025 stealth-fetch detection. Gemini training & grounding posture. Robots.txt token only; no separate UA. Independent of Googlebot ranking - pure policy decision. ByteDance crawler governance for TikTok recommendation training and Doubao LLM. No first-party docs - third-party fingerprinting only. Amazon's three-bot fleet. Amazonbot trains, Amzn-SearchBot powers Alexa/Rufus search (does NOT train), Amzn-User handles live consumer queries. llms.txt spec compliance. 12 rules from llmstxt.org. Letter grading, per-rule prescriptions. Largest Contentful Paint. Mobile + desktop p75 vs Google's 2.5s threshold, TTFB gate, SSR discoverability, render-blocking, and the LCP image stack (preload, fetchpriority, lazy posture, modern format, dimensions). Interaction to Next Paint. Mobile + desktop p75 vs Google's 200ms threshold, TBT lab gate, main-thread work, third-party JS share, bundle size, DOM size, unused JavaScript. Cumulative Layout Shift. Mobile + desktop p75 vs Google's 0.1 threshold, zero shift elements, sized images, font-display posture, viewport meta, late-loading content checks. Time to First Byte. Mobile + desktop p75 vs Google's 800ms threshold, HTTP/2 adoption, text compression, preconnect hints, CDN detection, stricter origin response gate. First Contentful Paint. Mobile + desktop p75 vs Google's 1.8s threshold, render-blocking, text compression, font-display, preconnect