s.txt + Organization schema, cross-engine citation (Perplexity/Gemini/Claude), primary-source authority, brand corpus presence (Wikipedia/Wikidata), competitor bid alignment, and session frequency caps. Product rich result + Google Shopping Merchant Listing + Rufus eligibility. 14 rules covering identifier, condition, return policy, availability, and snippet basics. Knowledge Panel anchor + AI entity recognition. name, url, logo, sameAs, contactPoint, address, legalName. Sitelinks Search Box on brand SERPs. SearchAction wiring, urlTemplate placeholder, query-input syntax, publisher reference. Breadcrumb trail under SERP URL. itemListElement structure, position monotonicity, ListItem name + item URL validity. Top Stories + Discover eligibility. Article / BlogPosting / NewsArticle. headline, image, datePublished, author, publisher logo, mainEntityOfPage. ChatGPT / Perplexity / Claude / Gemini citation favorite for direct-answer queries. Question + acceptedAnswer integrity, answer quality, uniqueness. Star ratings under SERP titles + AI trust signal. AggregateRating completeness, Review author validation, reviewBody quality, dates. Local pack + Knowledge Panel + GBP enrichment. PostalAddress completeness, opening hours, geo coords, priceRange, aggregateRating. E-E-A-T author entity for byline-attributed AI citations. name, url, sameAs to authority profiles, jobTitle, worksFor, knowsAbout. Video rich result + SERP carousel + AI engine video citation. name, description, thumbnailUrl, uploadDate ISO 8601, content/embed URL, duration ISO 8601, publisher. Stop Guessing. Start Seeing. Get Cortex. More conversions, lower cost, zero guesswork. Cortex is your digital marketing optimization engine - it knows every platform best practice, monitors and assesses your performance 24/7, and automatically optimizes your accounts. Bring your marketing into the future with Cortex - powered by AI, perfected by experts.",
