e needs. £699 / month FEATURES Customisable content types and tone of voice Full feature access including Bulk generation up to 100 products at a time Dedicated account management and ongoing support More about Descriptionwise Descriptionwise is an AI-powered content generation platform specifically designed for eCommerce businesses. It helps merchandising teams create high-quality, unique product descriptions at scale. Our advanced AI technology analyzes product data, images, and your brand guidelines to generate compelling content that improves SEO, increases conversion rates, and significantly reduces the time and cost associated with creating product descriptions. Whether you’re launching new products, refreshing your existing catalog, or expanding to new markets, Descriptionwise empowers your team to create consistent, engaging content across all your sales channels and in multiple languages. Our AI technology analyzes product data and images to create unique, engaging descriptions that highlight key features and benefits. This improves SEO, increases conversion rates, and saves time for merchandising teams. Clients typically report time savings of 70-90% on product content creation tasks. This allows your team to focus on strategy and high-value activities instead of repetitive writing. Absolutely! Our Starter plan offers pre-set tone of voice options, while our Enterprise plan allows for full customization to perfectly match your brand’s unique voice and style. Yes, our AI generates unique content for each product, even within similar categories. This helps avoid duplicate content penalties and improves your site’s SEO performance.",
