    "content": "Designrr Lifetime Deal — Your eBook, written and designed for $27 Powered by AI that writes in your voice From the world's largest eBook creation company — trusted by 450,000+ authors, coaches & creators Create, Design & Publish Stunning eBooks In 2 Minutes Without Writing A Word Answer a few simple questions. WordGenie™, Designrr's built-in AI, writes your draft so it actually sounds like you — then 100+ professional templates design it. No writing skills. No design skills. No monthly fee. 🛡️ 30-day money-back guarantee · No questions asked ✓ Build authority in your niche✓ Sell on Amazon & Kindle✓ Grow your list with lead magnets✓ Create interactive flipbooks✓ Commercial license included 450,000+customers worldwide 1.9M+eBooks published 83countries 40,000+member community The real problem Two hurdles stop almost every eBook from getting finished. ✍️ Writing the content 🎨 Getting it designed You sit down to share what you know — something meaningful, something that could genuinely help people. But the words don't come. Or worse: they do, and they don't sound like you at all. So you try AI, and get something generic and robotic. You try Canva, and lose a weekend to formatting. You price out a freelancer, and wince. All you wanted was a simple way to turn your knowledge into something real: an eBook you can sell, a lead magnet that grows your list, an asset that builds your authority. Designrr removes both hurdles at once — and you're about to see exactly how. ⚡ Meet WordGenie™ From a few questions to a finished eBook — in 4 steps. WordGenie™ was trained on thousands of our users' most successful eBooks and lead magnets — so it writes content that connects, in your voice. Not cookie-cutter. Not robotic. Yours. 1 Answer a few simple questions Share your topic, pick your niche, describe your audience. No prompts to engineer, no blank page to stare at. Already have content? Import it from Word, Google Docs, a PDF, or any webpage instead. 2 Approve your outline & title WordGenie™ structures your book around your strengths, then suggests titles modeled on thousands of bestsellers — because your title can drive up to 80% of your book's success. Tweak, regenerate, or rearrange anything in seconds. 3 Get your full draft, instantly Every chapter, written in your voice. Add your own stories and examples, regenerate any section you don't love, and drop in images from a built-in royalty-free library of millions. 4 Design & publish in one click Pick from 100+ professional templates, customize with drag-and-drop, then export as a polished PDF, an interactive flipbook, or embed it on your site. Sell it, share it, or grow your list with it. 100+ templates designed to be judged by their cover. 57% of readers buy a book based on its cover alone — and 80% avoid books with bad design. Every Designrr template is built by professional designers and fully customizable: fonts, colors, images, layout. No code, no Photoshop. Whether it's a lead magnet, a Kindle book, or a client project — you'll look like a pro without hiring one. Everything included One platform. Idea to published eBook. 📖 Animated flipbooks Turn any eBook into an interactive flipbook — mobile-friendly, easy to share, and protected from downloading. 🖼️ Millions of royalty-free images Search Unsplash and Pixabay right inside the app, or upload your own to a personal media library. ✂️ Built-in image editor Crop, resize, recolor, and tweak images without ever leaving Designrr. No Photoshop required. 📑 Automatic table of contents One click generates a clickable TOC with page numbers, headers, and footers — all customizable. 📝 Distraction-free draft editor Write, paste, and organize chapters in a clean writing space, then merge drafts into your final book with one click. ♻️ Edit & re-publish forever Your content stays fully editable. Update a chapter, re-export, repeat — as many times as you like, for life. Real customers 450,000 customers can't be wrong. Unsolicited words from people who started exactly where you are. ★★★★★ \"I paid the $27, picked a niche, created an ebook in about 2 hours, and listed it for sale on Kindle and Amazon. Easy process — very happy with the service!\" K Kindle PublisherVerified customer ★★★★★ \"I purchased the $27 plan a couple of days ago and it exponentially exceeds the price in value. I've already created 3 PDF ebooks — it's very intuitive, and the community is so supportive.\" S New AuthorVerified customer ★★★★★ \"I completed my first book in just 4 days. I'm a 50+ holistic life counselor and it was an amazing experience — the e-book is beautiful and it's ready to publish!\" H Holistic Life CounselorFirst-time author 🎁 But that's not all Over $1,000 in bonuses — free when you join today. #1 Commercial License $497 value — yours free Legally sell the eBooks you create. Build unlimited books for clients, keep 100% of what you charge, and offer services on Upwork, Fiverr, or your own site — no royalties, no fees. #2 Weekly Live Coaching $197/month value — yours free Jump on exclusive weekly calls with Designrr's founder and team. Get expert guidance on creating, designing, and selling eBooks — and fire away with your questions, live. #3 Ultimate Guide to Building an Author Website $250 value — yours free A straightforward, step-by-step guide to a website that showcases your books, establishes your expertise, and attracts readers — even with zero tech experience. #4 Content Marketing for Dummies eBook $47 value — yours free Written by Designrr CEO Paul Clifford: the 5-step framework behind 10M+ organic visitors — perfect for selling your eBook without relying on paid ads. #5 Private Community — 40,000+ Members $97/month value — yours free Instant access to a support group of authors, coaches, and creators. Ask questions, share wins, get feedback, and join weekly livestreams. Total bonus value: $1,088+ · Your price today: $27 ⚡ Special lifetime offer Designrr Lifetime Access $324/year$27one-time Pay once. Use it forever. No subscription. Everything you get WordGenie™ AI writing assistant (credits included free) Try everything for 30 days. Love it or get every penny back. Use the AI, explore the templates, join a coaching call, download your eBook. If it's not the right fit for any reason, just let us know and we'll refund your payment — no questions asked, no stress, no pressure. And while you decide, our 24/7 live chat team (real humans) is one click away inside the app. P.S. This isn't just about software. For many of our users, Designrr became something more. Marco used Designrr to create a comforting guide for his father undergoing dialysis — turning complex, emotional challenges into something clear, helpful, and beautifully presented. William, a bestselling author and six-time Amazon All-Star recipient, hadn't written in almost a decade after a period of deep personal loss. Designrr helped him rediscover his voice — and inspired him to write again. Stories like these are why we do what we do. If you're ready to create something that matters — we're here to help. You do — 100%. We don't own or retain any rights to your content. We just provide the technology. Is this really a one-time payment? Yes. $27 once, lifetime access. No subscription, no renewal, no surprise charges. Do I have to buy AI credits to use WordGenie™? No. We operate a fair-use policy and allocate credits as needed. If you ever need more, just ask support and we'll add them to your account for free. How many eBooks can I publish? As many as you like. Create unlimited projects, download them to your machine, and come back to edit and re-publish anytime. Flipbooks: this offer includes up to 10 active flipbooks at once. Do I need any design or tech skills? None. The templates are professionally designed and the drag-and-drop editor is built for non-designers. You can add your own logo, fonts, and brand colors too. Can I update my eBook after publishing? Yes — edit, update, and republish at any time