eatures. Just a fast generator built for real use. No CAD vocabulary needed. Describe your space in plain English and the AI floor plan generator handles room layout, walls, doors and dimensions. Switch to 3D Visualization and turn your prompt or photo into a downloadable GLB model. Rotate, zoom in the browser; open in Blender, Unity, Unreal, three.js or Apple Vision Pro. 2-3 minutes per model. Pick from technical blueprint, watercolor, marker pen, anime, 2.5D, 3D isometric and photorealistic. Layer in Modern, Scandinavian, Japandi, Mid-Century, Bohemian, Farmhouse or Industrial interior style. Upload up to 16 reference photos — sketches, existing plans or interior shots — and let the AI floor plan creator restyle the layout while keeping your structure. Try one 1K floor plan free after Google sign-in. Then $19/mo for 300 credits, or $19 one-time for 240. 3D models cost 10 credits each. Top-up credits never expire. Your prompts, reference images, generated floor plans and 3D models stay yours. We do not train models on your designs and we don't share your inputs with third parties. Three audiences, one tool. Whether you renovate your home, list a hundred properties, or need a 3D model for your scene, the generator fits in. Use the AI floor plan generator to test 5 different layouts in 5 minutes, then bring the one you love to a pro. Skip the $1k concept fee. Describe each unit in one sentence and get a clean PNG floor plan for the MLS — or a downloadable 3D model for an interactive listing page. No draftsperson needed. Skip the modelling step. Type a prompt or upload a reference render, download a GLB, and import directly into Blender, Unity, Unreal or three.js. Commercial use included on Pro and Team plans. Pick a plan that fits your usage. Yearly saves 20%. One-time = no recurring billing, ever. 1 credit on signup Try the AI floor plan generator with no commitment. 300 credits / month For homeowners, creators and 3D designers who want unlimited renders. 1500 credits / month For real estate teams shipping floor plans and 3D listings daily. Common questions about our AI floor plan generator — accuracy, formats, privacy and what is on the roadmap. Describe your space. Get an AI floor plan in seconds, or a real 3D model in minutes. Google sign-in required. 1 plan free trial, no card needed.",
