thers to give AI an extra context to make better results. White-label Remove our brand completely & make it yours. Upload logo, icons, update design palette and all texts. Custom domains You and your customers can access your Portal with all AI tools on any domain or subdomain. Powerful AI models Utilize the best AI models. We use models from OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, and keep adding more. Email automation Native email outreach integration you can use to send emails with dynamic data to your customers. Monetization models You can do subscriptions, one-time payment, credit-based pricing, free trials, and more! Custom design Style your tools and portals as you wish! Upload your design assets, change colors, fonts and buttons. Embed options Just copy unique iframe code to set up a tool anywhere on your website. It natively fits into your content. 200+ templates in 12 categories Choose from ready-made tools, or copy entire Collections to save hours building it from scratch. Didn't find what you are looking for? Create new tools using our no-code Builder. Start building Build your AI portal in minutes Starting a new AI business used to take days. NOT ANYMORE! #2 Customize design and texts Personalize tools and set up integrations. #3 Publish and share it with the world Built for non-techies. Easy setup in seconds. Do you like our platform?   Let's work together! Let's work together! We invite all creators to join our affiliate program, help us spread the word and earn money by producing content about our platform. #1 Use FoxyApps We empower creators to build awesome projects using our app builder and document it. #2 Publish content online Share your content with the community. We highlight best videos on our socials too! #3 Cash out! We share revenue with our creators. You earn 30% commission fee from all payments.",
