orm supports text chat, voice messages, and image sharing. Characters can send photos and respond to images you share with them. Is it safe? Yes, your privacy and security are our top priorities. All conversations are encrypted, and we never share your personal data with third parties. Can I create my own AI Friend? This feature is coming soon! We're working on allowing users to customize their own AI companions with unique personalities and appearances.",
