    "content": "AI for Excel and Google Sheets Check and write formulas, apply formatting, draw charts, build dashboards, generate insights. Clean and dedupe data, generate and translate content, tag and enrich, row-by-row at scale. Why choose GPT for Work Unmatched in ease of use, speed, breadth and reliability for spreadsheet work. Reliable bulk workflows Apply a prompt template reliably, row by row, to hundreds of thousands of rows, with up to 1,000 answers per minute depending on the model and task. Watch it in action Super fast Whether you’re writing formulas, formatting data, creating charts, let alone applying row-by-row bulk processing, GPT for Work is much faster than competing spreadsheet add-ons like Copilot or Claude. Review speed benchmark No AI lock-in Always use what’s best for you. Large choice of AI providers and models. Set API key or custom endpoint if needed. Browse AI providers and models Real human support 98% CSAT thanks to human answers. No AI chatbot driving you mad. Under 1 hour average response time (outside nights/weekends). Check Trustpilot reviews “You built a game-changing tool with GPT for Work” “For the past two years, I’ve been using GPT for Sheets by Talarian to carry out many of my SEO optimization tasks.” “If you spend your day in spreadsheets, this is one of the few AI tools that actually earns its place in your workflow.” “We integrated GPTforWork.com into our Google Sheets and Excel workflows, and the math completely changed” Get formulas, format, fix errors, analyze data The agent writes formulas, detects and fixes errors, formats cells, builds pivot tables, cleans data, creates charts, analyzes trends, and builds models - directly in your spreadsheet. Bulk processing with AI, at scale, row-by-row The agent fills out a table at speed, using subagents to apply prompts to every row in parallel. Clean, translate, categorize, generate, enrich, score, deduplicate - across thousands of rows. The agent writes one prompt template per column. No prompt engineering required. The agent automatically selects the right model for your task. No need to be a model expert. Up to 1,000 answers per minute depending on model, input size and task complexity Up to hundreds of thousands rows per run on Sheets and up to 1M on Excel Track progress in real-time, stop in one click, fine-grained control interface if needed. GPT functions: prompt AI directly from cells Use =GPT() and other specialized functions to generate and edit content, translate, classify, extract, etc. Reference other cells and ranges from a GPT function to create dynamic prompts that react to changes. Drag to apply across thousands of cells. Use a basis for reactive slides. Autosheet: the way AI uses Google Sheets Connect your AI agent to Google Sheets over MCP. Autosheet runs the GPT for Sheets agent from Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, or any MCP client.  Just send a prompt and a Google Sheet URL. Also available as an HTTP API for workflows and code. Built for people who work with spreadsheets From everyday operators to power users. It can speed up anyone. Consulting Restructure datasets Run research and analysis Produce decision-ready summaries Finance & Accounting Close faster Standardize exports Reconcile data Validate formulas Build forecast models Sales & RevOps Clean pipeline data Enrich records Score leads Project growth E-commerce & SEO Generate and translate catalog content Enrich attributes Scale metadata workflows HR & people ops Analyze headcount Build compensation models Clean employee data Inventory & supply chain Track stock levels Standardize supplier data Support demand planning Trust & security Security and governance are built into how GPT for Work is operated and deployed. ISO 27001 Certified and maintained GDPR compliant Privacy and data protection built in SSO Microsoft Entra ID and Google OIDC Your data is yours Your data is never used to train language models Encryption Data is encrypted in transit and at rest Admin controls Centralized billing and usage controls",
