    "content": "Get better results from your emails with the power of AI AI for smarter email Accelerate your email creation with AI tuned for marketing — faster drafts, sharper messaging, and better results. AI subject line generator Get more opens from AI-optimized subject lines and stand out in your subscribers’ inboxes. Industry-specific optimization Effortlessly create emails tailored to your business based on keywords and industry trends. Multilingual support COMING SOON Generate content in the language of your audience and save time on translations. Create engaging emails 85% faster GetResponse customers using the AI Email Generator cut their email creation time by 85% — without losing their unique voice. „I love GetResponse AI Email Generator. It creates excellent copy and gives me ideas that I can edit and add to my email marketing. It has increased my open rates on the tested emails.” How to generate an AI email template Thanks to OpenAI technology, you can create an entire email in just a few clicks. All you need to do is provide keywords, choose your industry, the tone and design direction, and your AI-generated email and subject line will be ready in less than a minute. Define your email goal Type keywords or phrases relevant to your email goal – it could be a seasonal sale, a new product, or anything else you want to announce to your subscribers. Then choose a category that best suits your business. Set the tone Choose how you would like your email to sound. Select the tone that matches the sentiment you’re looking to communicate. Choose the design Set the layout and color scheme. If your layout features an image, the template will include a relevant stock photo from our free images library. Customize and send There you have it – a complete email template including copy, image, and subject line. Add a few custom touches if needed and send. See how easy it is to generate a custom AI email template Kickoff your AI marketing strategy with optimized emails Introduce cutting-edge AI tools for email writing and create high quality emails in a matter of seconds. Win back your time with help from an AI email generator Don’t waste time manually brainstorming, typing, editing, and building emails from scratch. Quickly generate emails with text based on the AI’s identification of high performing industry trends and your keywords. custom templates including copy and image engaging and industry-optimized text and subject lines GetResponse customers using the AI email creator saw a 85% decrease in the email creation time. A/B test new ways to captivate your audience Increase open and click-through rates with data-backed optimization. Keep running A/B tests to identify words and phrases that best resonate with your audience. With the AI subject line generator, you can constantly test various subject lines tailored to your industry and stand out in your subscribers’ inboxes with every email. I do appreciate the extra assistance. I think it will help me get better conversion rates” Level up your brainstorming with an AI email assistant Spark up creativity whenever you get writer’s block. With the AI email generator, you can create an entire email with a few key details and a couple of clicks. Quickly brainstorm new ideas to draft compelling emails based on OpenAI's access to your industry's latest trends. Increase your email marketing ROI with the GetResponse MAX AI email creation solution powered by the technology behind ChatGPT – no OpenAI account required. Let our AI assistant help you write optimized texts for all of your emails – autoresponders, automations, newsletters, and more. COMING SOON A/B tests AI enhancement Increase your open rates with no extra effort. Run more A/B tests of subject lines based on your email content. Try AI email campaigns free today CREATE FREE ACCOUNT \"Remarkable surprise to discover. The AI system has written my short promotion emails far better than my own. I have generated more replies than ever.” Learn what are the benefits of email marketing and how to do it effectively. READ THE GUIDE › Frequently asked questions How does AI Email Writer work? AI Email Writer uses machine learning and natural language processing to generate well-structured emails based on your input. It analyzes prompts, subject matter, and tone preferences to craft engaging content that suits your campaign needs. The AI refines its output based on best practices, ensuring clarity, persuasiveness, and readability. Is AI Email Writer suitable for all types of emails? Yes, AI Email Writer can generate emails for marketing campaigns, newsletters, follow-ups, promotions, and customer engagement. However, for sensitive topics such as legal or highly personalized messages, manual review is recommended to ensure accuracy, compliance, and a human touch where necessary. Can I customize the AI-generated emails? Absolutely. AI-generated emails provide a structured foundation, but you can edit, refine, and personalize them to match your brand voice and campaign goals. Most AI tools, including GetResponse AI Email Writer, allow users to adjust tone, length, and key messaging to align with their audience. How accurate is the AI-generated content? AI-generated content is highly accurate in grammar, readability, and structure, but human review is recommended for brand alignment and nuanced messaging. The AI follows email marketing best practices but may require slight tweaks to enhance personalization, ensure compliance, and maintain brand-specific tone. Can I use AI Email Writer for sensitive matters? While AI Email Writer can draft professional emails, it's best to review content when dealing with sensitive matters like legal, medical, or confidential business communications. AI-generated emails should be manually checked to ensure proper tone, compliance, and adherence to company policies. Is AI Email Writer a free tool? AI Email Writer availability depends on the platform. GetResponse offers AI-powered email writing as part of its email marketing suite. Some providers offer free trials or basic AI email writing features, while advanced functionalities typically require a paid plan for full access. How does AI Email Writer generate email? AI Email Writer processes user input, campaign goals, and audience details to generate email content. It follows best practices, optimizing for engagement, readability, and conversions. The AI suggests subject lines, email copy, and CTAs while ensuring professional tone and structure. Is AI Email Writer better than ChatGPT? AI Email Writer is tailored specifically for email marketing, offering structured, campaign-ready content optimized for engagement. Unlike ChatGPT, which generates broad content, GetResponse’s AI Email Writer integrates with marketing automation, ensuring email optimization and improved deliverability. What sets our AI Email Writer apart from similar tools? GetResponse AI Email Writer is designed for seamless email marketing execution. It not only generates email copy but also optimizes subject lines, CTAs, and formatting for improved conversions. Its deep integration with automation workflows and analytics makes it a complete solution for email marketers. Do I need any technical expertise to use this tool? No technical skills are required. GetResponse AI Email Writer is user-friendly, offering intuitive text generation based on simple inputs. Users can enter basic details, adjust preferences, and receive polished emails instantly, making it accessible for beginners and experienced marketers alike. Is AI Email Writer secure and privacy-conscious? Most AI email generators, including GetResponse, prioritize data security with encryption and compliance measures. User data is not stored or shared externally, ensuring that generated content remains private and meets GDPR and other email security standards.",
