eader-friendly copy that brings visitors to your website. Getsolved brings the most effective tools you need when polishing texts into a single workspace. Use the following secondary tools to improve your workflow: Our tool brings several writing tasks into one place. You can generate a draft, rewrite sentences, correct grammar and spelling, adjust tone, check for AI patterns, and review factual claims. Yes, it can. Once you share your text and select the right function, our tool will rewrite every single section that needs to be refined in order to improve it. However, make sure to always keep a copy of the original text to compare the results. Any kind of text you can think of. For example, articles, reports, blog posts, cover letters, resumes, and much more. The assistant can identify repetitive wording, robotic phrasing, and other patterns that may make a draft sound like AI. It can then suggest clearer alternatives while keeping the original meaning and tone. Yes, you can! Our fact checker can flag statements that may need verification. You can review these parts of the text as you edit instead of using a separate tool for each check. Yes. While pasting the text can be quicker for some, you can also upload DOCX, TXT, PDF, and other types of files.",
