essons with your videos and learning materials. Promote with the help of your AI Coach You launched your course, and now what? How do you get members? Heights AI Coach is here to help! Jump on a coaching session with the AI and share your goals, struggles, and progress. Heights AI Coach will tell you exactly what steps to take to reach your goals, based on your unique situation. Start making sales and engage learners in the community Now that you've got your first members, Heights Platform’s gamification tools will keep them engaged. You can also build a community to interact with your learners and keep them coming back to your program!",
