    "content": "All of your AI agents, managed in one place. Build demand, win deals, and serve your customers with a team of AI agents for marketing, sales, and customer service. Built on your CRM data, agents have the context they need to drive results. Most teams piece together campaigns across too many tools, with too much manual work between each step. Campaign agent plans it. Content agent creates it. Nurture agent converts it — so your team goes from a single goal to a live, converting campaign without the back-and-forth. Your reps lose hours to research, follow-up, and CRM updates. That time should be spent closing. Prospecting agent watches accounts for signals that they're ready to buy and reaches out automatically, while smart deal progression keeps deals moving after every call, with next steps handled for them. Customer service teams spend days on repeat questions while the complex cases wait in the queue. Customer agent resolves common questions 24/7, with answers grounded in real contact and contract history, so your team is free for the conversations that need a human. research and insight tasks automated Your team loses hours researching customers manually, and reps still go into outreach guessing. Data agent answers custom questions about any contact or company using the signals already in your CRM, so reps know exactly who to reach and why. Track what your agents are doing and delivering in one view. Keep what's working, adjust what's not, and turn on the agents you haven't started using. No code required Live status and real outcomes for each agent Activate or configure any agent in one click Turn on ready-made agents for marketing, sales, and customer service, or build your own. Just describe what you need to Breeze Assistant in plain language, and it builds from your CRM data and your processes. No coding required. No setup needed to connect your data Agents grounded in live customer information Accessible directly from Breeze Assistant whereve