    "content": "Record Zoom, Google Meet, or Teams, upload audio or PDFs, or paste a YouTube link—HyNote transcribes, summarizes, and extracts action items in seconds. 1M+ users on iOS, Android, and Web · 4.8/5.0 rated · 6,718 App Store and 3,750 Google Play ratings · Product Hunt 1.1K followers Our AI note taker is trusted by over 1M+ professionals and students worldwide. The Productivity Powerhouse for AI Note-Taking HyNote transcribes meetings, summarizes PDFs and videos, and extracts action items—instantly, across 8 input types and 50+ languages. Your AI Productivity Tool Built to Boost Business Efficiency Capture Everything Eight input types—live audio, uploaded MP3/WAV/M4A/AAC, video, PDFs, image OCR, YouTube links, web capture, and phone calls. HyNote transcribes or summarizes each into searchable notes you can chat with. HyNote's abstractive AI reads transcripts and documents to produce summaries, key points, action items, and meeting minutes in seconds. Choose from 30+ professional templates (SWOT, interviews, study notes, follow-ups) and export to PDF, TXT, Google Docs, or Notion. Transcribe Zoom, Google Meet, Teams, and Webex without a meeting bot—live or from a recording. Speaker identification, timestamps, and 50+ languages included. AES-256 encryption at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit, and SOC 2 Type II infrastructure. GDPR, CCPA, and HIPAA-aligned workflows with private storage—built for healthcare, legal, and enterprise teams. Export to Google Docs, Notion, PDF, or TXT in one click. On mobile, share via the iOS or Android share sheet to email and messaging apps. Sync with Google Calendar and Apple Calendar. Get answers to help your team unlock HyNote's full potential. What is HyNote? HyNote is an AI note-taking app that turns meetings, audio, PDFs, videos, and links into searchable notes. It offers instant summarization, meeting transcription, multimodal capture (8 input types), audio-to-text in 50+ languages, productivity integrations, and encrypted compliance-ready storage. Trusted by 1M+ professionals and students worldwide. How does HyNote work? Capture content—record a live meeting, upload audio/video/PDF, or paste a YouTube or web link. HyNote's AI Core Engine transcribes speech (up to 99% accuracy for clear audio), applies instant summarization with key points and action items, and outputs structured notes via 30+ professional templates. Export to Google Docs, Notion, PDF, or TXT—usually in under a minute. How does HyNote instant summarization work? HyNote uses abstractive summarization—not just keyword extraction—to read full transcripts or documents and generate concise summaries, key points, action items, and meeting minutes. Output formats include brief summaries, structured meeting notes, study notes, and 30+ professional templates (SWOT, interviews, follow-up emails). Results are ready in seconds and can be exported to PDF, TXT, Google Docs, or Notion. What types of content can I use with HyNote? HyNote supports eight multimodal inputs: (1) live audio recording for meetings and lectures; (2) uploaded audio/video in MP3, WAV, M4A, and AAC; (3) PDF documents for summarization and chat; (4) images with OCR for whiteboards and slides; (5) YouTube links for video transcripts and summaries; (6) web page capture; (7) phone call recordings; and (8) Apple Watch recordings. Each input is processed into a transcript, summary, or both. Does HyNote support live meeting transcription? Yes. HyNote transcribes Zoom, Google Meet, Microsoft Teams, and Webex—live during the call or from an uploaded recording afterward. No meeting bot joins your call; you record from your device. Features include up to 99% accuracy for clear speech (internal benchmarks), speaker identification for up to 10 speakers, timestamps, and 50+ languages. Supported audio formats include MP3, WAV, M4A, and AAC. What productivity tools does HyNote integrate with? HyNote integrates with Google Docs and Notion for one-click export of transcripts and summaries, and with Google Calendar and Apple Calendar for meeting sync. Download as PDF or TXT. On iOS and Android, share via the native share sheet to email and messaging apps — not a direct Slack or WhatsApp integration. For meetings, record Zoom, Google Meet, Microsoft Teams, or Webex from your device—no native bot required. Is my data secure with HyNote? HyNote encrypts all data at rest with AES-256 and in transit with TLS 1.3, hosted on SOC 2 Type II infrastructure. The platform is designed for GDPR, CCPA, and HIPAA-aligned workflows, with private encrypted storage for sensitive meetings and documents. Enterprise teams can use 2FA, SSO, and audit logging. Suitable for healthcare, legal, finance, and other regulated industries. Can I use HyNote across all my devices? Yes. HyNote syncs in real time across web, iPhone, Android, iPad, Apple Watch, and a Chrome extension—start on one device, continue on another. Can I share notes with my team? Yes. Share notes instantly, or export to Google Docs, Notion, PDF, or TXT. On iOS and Android, send content via the native share sheet to email and messaging apps. Calendar integrations include Google Calendar and Apple Calendar for scheduling follow-ups from action items. Who is HyNote built for? HyNote is built for professionals and students alike, including product managers, sales teams, researchers, founders, and creative teams who need to capture and act on information quickly. Are there plans for teams or enterprises? Yes, please fill out this form and we will reach out with the next steps. Never take notes again Join 1M+ users who have elevated productivity with HyNote. Join thousands of teams using HyNote to streamline their workflows. Experience the power of AI meeting notes and real-time transcription. ★ ★ ★ ★ ★ 03/09/2025 Sarah Chen Game-changer for our weekly standups! Our engineering team was drowning in meeting notes until we discovered HyNote's AI note taker. Now every sprint planning session gets automatically converted into actionable insights. The AI summaries are spot-on and save us hours of manual documentation. Our PMs love how they can quickly reference key decisions and action items. ★ ★ ★ ★ ★ 03/01/2025 Marcus Rodriguez Finally, meetings that actually produce results As a product manager, I was spending more time taking notes than actually leading discussions. HyNote's AI note taker changed everything - it captures the essence of our brainstorming sessions and turns them into structured insights. The workflow integration is seamless, and my team can focus on what matters most. ★ ★ ★ ★ ★ 02/18/2025 Dr. Emily Watson Research meetings transformed Leading a research team means juggling multiple complex discussions daily. HyNote's ability to distill our academic conversations into clear, actionable points is incredible. It's like having a brilliant AI note taker who never misses a detail. Our publication process has never been smoother. ★ ★ ★ ★ ★ 7 February 2025 Alex Thompson Sales team productivity skyrocketed Our sales calls used to be a black hole of information. With HyNote's AI note taker, every client conversation becomes a treasure trove of insights. The AI captures customer pain points, follow-up actions, and competitive intel perfectly. Our conversion rates have improved by 30% since we started using it. ★ ★ ★ ★ ★ 8 January 2025 Lisa Park Design critiques are now constructive Creative teams need feedback that moves projects forward. HyNote transforms our design reviews from chaotic discussions into structured improvement plans. Every suggestion gets captured and organized by the AI note taker, making our iteration process incredibly efficient. ★ ★ ★ ★ ★ 20 January 2025 David O'Connor Board meetings that drive decisions As a startup founder, I need every board meeting to count. HyNote's AI note taker ensures that strategic discussions translate into clear next steps. Investors appreciate the professional summaries, and our team execution has never been better. It