ach, engagement, and ROI. ‌ ‌ Zuzana Chmelová and Radek Šimík Influencer Relations Managers “Audience insights kept our brand image strong.” HypeAuditor has been an invaluable influencer management solution for us in identifying influencers who align with our brand’s luxury image and engage authentically with their audience. The platform’s audience insights and fraud detection tools have helped us maintain campaign credibility and efficiency across our global properties. One standout influencer campaign reached over half a million users with excellent engagement. I think it's fair to say HypeAuditor has been a very reliable influencer marketing tool in being able to narrow down audiences of influencers that we’re targeting across the world. ‌ James Karuga Associate Director “We scaled to 17,000 athlete profiles with HypeAuditor’s data.” At Total Player Value, gathering accurate data on thousands of college athletes was a challenge, especially with most athletes being nano-influencers. HypeAuditor’s API helped us streamline data collection and benchmarking, allowing us to quickly pull key metrics like engagement rates and audience sizes. Now, we’ve built profiles for over 17,000 athletes and are on track to reach 40,000. The benchmarking feature helps athletes understand their performance and value, making it easier for them to monetize their social media presence. In the past year, Moon Magic spent a lot of time manually analyzing influencer profiles and gathering data. But once we found HypeAuditor, it saved us so much time. We now have easy access to detailed metrics like engagement rates, audience authenticity, and influencer profiles – all in one influencer management software. We’ve been able to expand our influencer marketing strategy, build relationships with proven influencers, and save time on reporting. The automated reports and influencer tracking tools have made our work so much easier. ‌ Flora Macher Influencer Relations Manager “HypeAuditor helped us u