    "content": "The AI Visibility Platform Built Around How You Work Wellows gives you the intelligence to understand, track, and grow your brand's presence across AI, tailored for your role, your team, and your clients. Business Owners & CMOs Know exactly how AI platforms are representing your brand and fix what's hurting you See where you stand against competitors and identify what is holding you back Find out which prompts are shaping buyer decisions and use them to your advantage Turn AI visibility data into a focused plan your entire marketing team can act on I've been testing a tool called Wellows that turns these hidden signals into real visibility. The workflow is surprisingly smart! Mike GinleySr. SEO Professional If you want to measure AI visibility, reliably track your LLM citations, identify where competitors are winning, and systematically close those gaps. That's exactly what Wellows is built for. Vladi KriulinContent Strategist You're guessing which sites to contact. Guessing what to say. Guessing if it'll even move the needle on AI visibility. That's where Wellows turns this into a repeatable system. And it's why I've decided to use this. Alex GrobermanFounder, Alex Groberman Labs Your client's competitors are being cited by ChatGPT. Your client isn't. And until you fix that, the gap is only going to widen. The strategy is simple. Get your client onto the pages that LLMs already trust. But finding those pages? That used to be a nightmare. Wellows changes this completely. Freddie ChattEcommerce SEO Consultant Closes the loop Why Wellows? The AI visibility platform that closes the loop. Most platforms report visibility. Wellows connects insight to execution: visibility tracking, outreach opportunities, content generation, AI content optimization, and proof of impact. 01 AI visibility tracking tool for real answer engines Track citations and visibility across ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, AI Overviews, and AI Mode in one dashboard designed for daily monitoring. Two recent customers turned hidden AI search demand into measurable visibility gains in weeks — not quarters. purevpn 45 days Citations 6.5%increased to24.3% In 45 days, grew citations from 6.5% to 24.3% on ChatGPT and Perplexity. ChatGPT Perplexity VETTIO 68 days AI citation share 3.8%increased to21.6% In 68 days, boosted AI citation share from 3.8% to 21.6% on Google AI Overview and ChatGPT. Google AI Overview ChatGPT Before you start Frequently Asked Questions Quick answers to the questions teams ask before kicking off their AI visibility program. Can't find what you're looking for? Contact support Why is Wellows one of the best AI visibility platforms? Wellows is built specifically for the AI search layer. It is the only AI visibility platform that scores you on citations, meaning the actual URLs and sources AI systems pull from when they answer. Most platforms only count how often your brand name shows up in a response. That distinction matters because citations are the layer you can directly influence. Wellows tracks your citation footprint across ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Google AI Mode, Gemini, and Perplexity. It then closes the loop with Content Opportunities, Content Optimization, and Outreach Opportunities. Every metric leads to a specific next action, not just a dashboard number. Most platforms count brand mentions in AI responses, a lagging signal that moves when models retrain or prompts get rephrased. Wellows scores on explicit and implicit citations, the sources AI pulls from and the only layer you can actually move. Then evaluate LLM coverage (Wellows tracks five major answer engines), competitive benchmarking by topic and region, and whether the platform includes execution tools. A reporting tool shows you a score. Wellows pairs every score with Content Generation, Content Optimization, and Outreach Opportunities to act on it. What are the most important features in an AI visibility platform? The features that move the needle are citation tracking (not just mention tracking), multi-LLM coverage, competitive benchmarking, sentiment analysis, and an execution workflow. Wellows includes all of them. Your Brand Visibility Score is calculated on explicit citations (where AI directly cites your brand or links to your domain) and implicit citations (where a source page covers your topic but doesn’t include you yet). Top Cited Prompts shows which queries drive your visibility. Performance History tracks change over time. Quick Wins surfaces opportunities automatically. The platform points you at the next action, not just the current state. Are AI visibility platforms accurate and reliable? Accuracy depends on what the platform is actually measuring. Most platforms score visibility on brand mentions inside AI responses. That is a lagging signal that fluctuates when models retrain, prompts get rephrased, or competitors run noise campaigns. Wellows scores on citations, the actual sources AI systems pull from. That makes Wellows' Brand Visibility Score a leading indicator. It reflects something you can directly change by publishing content, earning placements, or fixing existing pages. Wellows runs your tracked prompts against five LLMs every 24 hours, separates explicit from implicit citations, and stores historical snapshots through Performance History, so the data is fully auditable. Is Wellows trustworthy for tracking AI citations? Yes. Wellows is purpose-built for AI search and doesn’t repurpose traditional SEO data. Each tracked prompt runs against ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Google AI Mode, Gemini, and Perplexity, with citations captured as actual URLs, not estimates or sampled mentions. Explicit and implicit citations are tracked as separate, first-class metrics. Every action inside your account is logged in Your Activity for full team auditability. Wellows also integrates with Google Search Console, so insights are grounded in your real first-party query data. Performance History lets you verify any historical date, making campaign impact measurable rather than anecdotal. Why choose Wellows over a free AI visibility tool? Free tools typically show a one-time snapshot of brand mentions, a single number with no source data behind it. Wellows is a continuous system. It tracks citations (the URLs feeding AI answers), refreshes every 24 hours, and stores historical data so you can measure change over time. Beyond measurement, Wellows includes Content Opportunities with estimated citation gain per piece, Content Optimization that scans your domain to prevent cannibalization, KIVA (the built-in AI Writing Agent), and Outreach Opportunities with verified contacts and ready-to-send templates. Free tools stop at a number. Wellows hands you the actions tied to it. The 7-day trial gives you the full platform to evaluate. Can an AI visibility platform actually increase citations? Yes. That is exactly why Wellows scores on citations rather than mentions. Mentions are a lagging outcome you can’t directly control. Citations are the leading indicator you can move by publishing the right content, earning placements on the right sources, and fixing pages you already own. Wellows turns that thesis into a workflow. Content Creation Opportunities surface topics where competitors are cited and you aren’t, with estimated citation gain per article. Content Optimization scans your domain to pick the single best page to update without cannibalizing others. Outreach Opportunities show high-authority URLs already citing competitors, with verified contacts to earn placement. Which AI platforms does Wellows support? Wellows tracks five major answer engines: ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Google AI Mode, Gemini, and Perplexity. You can filter your Brand Visibility Score by any single LLM to see where you over- or under-index, or view all five together for a complete picture. Each platform is monitored daily, with explicit and implicit citations, sentiment, and competitor benchmarks captured per prompt. This coverage reflects how your brand appears across the answer engines driving the majority of AI search traffic today. When Wellows tells you your citation footprint is shifting, you’re seeing the full picture, not a partial slice. Can I use Wellows across multiple brands or regions? Yes. Wellows is built for multi-brand and multi-region tracking, which is why agencies and enterprise teams adopt it. Each project tracks one brand and domain with its own competitors, topics, tracked prompts, and LLMs. Competitor lists can be managed independently per country (US, Canada, UK, New Zealand, and more). One seat gives your team a multi-project switcher to move between clients or sibling brands, with shared dashboards and team collaboration built in. Citation data, Content Opportunities, and Outreach Opportunities all stay scoped to the right project, so regional and brand-level insights never get mixed. How is an AI visibility platform different from traditional SEO tools? Traditional SEO tools track keyword rankings, backlinks, and crawl depth on web search engines. An AI visibility platform like Wellows tracks how AI answer engines cite, mention, and frame your brand in generated responses. It is a different layer with different rules. There is no page two in AI search: your brand is in the answer or it isn’t. Wellows doesn’t replace Semrush or Ahrefs; it works alongside them in the AI search layer. The closest analogy is backlinks. LLM Citations are the leading indicator for AI visibility the same way backlinks were for Google rankings. The difference is that the citation graph includes forum threads, reviews, and source URLs, not just hyperlinks. Get cited Start getting citedin AI search. See where your brand stands in AI search and take action to get cited more. Get a 90-day customized AI visibility plan.",
