y platform I know that can generate and post content on its own. Simply inputting info and they are always expanding their platform!\" What a month of content looks like Marky-generated posts for a dental practice — promos, national days, testimonials, and more. Get your own month of content. Frequently asked questions Everything you need to know about Marky. I already use ChatGPT. Why do I need this? ChatGPT is great — keep using it. The difference: ChatGPT doesn't schedule to your socials. Its images take a lot of back-and-forth and don't use your branding or photos, so they're often lower quality. Marky uses your brand and templates and gets you from idea to scheduled posts across all your platforms in one place. Is there a free trial? Yes, there's a two-week free trial, and you can even get started without entering your credit card at all. Will the posts actually perform well? Yes. Marky's AI is trained on high-performing content across industries. Posts are tailored to your brand and audience to maximize engagement. On average, businesses see 3x more views when they use Marky! What kind of business does Marky work best for? Marky works best for local service-based businesses — especially healthcare practices, professional services firms, home services companies, retail and hospitality businesses, and real estate professionals who rely on consistent social media to attract local customers. How long does setup take? Under 5 minutes. Enter your website URL and Marky instantly generates your first batch of content. No credit card required. Keep your business top of mind Join thousands of businesses posting high-quality content with Marky. Set up automatically in less than five minutes. Run an agency? See our white-label social media management for agencies. Comparing tools? See why we're the best AI social media post generator. Want to see your first posts before you go? Drop your website. We'll make you 10 free posts. No sign up needed.",
