r voiceovers. Can't Get More Sales People buy based on emotion and later justify it based on logic. In other words, if you can make your content sound professional and trigger emotion, then getting more sales will be a walk in the park. That’s exactly what a lot of our customers use Micmonster for - sales videos that work. Can't Get More Referrals Mouth to mouth is the best form of marketing ever. Once you win the trust of a person, they will go out and tell all of their friends about you. Think about what impact that will have on your business. It will sky-rocket. \n                            Unfortunately, Finding A   Talended Freelancer Isn’t That Easy\n                         Talended Freelancer Isn’t That Easy \n                         Finding a Talented Voice Over Is a Time-Consuming process. You have to post online requirements from your busy schedule, go through tons of requests, listen to a lot of voice samples, and negotiate the price Voice Talent is Expensive Professional voiceover charges between $20-100 for per minute of recording. And you can’t blame them, they have to spend money on studio & other equipment Turnaround Can be slow Voiceovers generally take a few days to deliver the voiceover. And because most projects need to complete voiceover before starting video production, you are forced to wait. Not to mention if the voiceover artist made a tiny mistake you have to wait another 2-3 days. \n                            Of course, you can record your own voice,   but unfortunately, that comes with its own   set of problems ….\n                         but unfortunately, that comes with its own set of problems …. \n                         \n                                    Creating your own voiceover may sound good in theory but not very practical, especially if you can relate to any of the following:  I don't like the sound of my voice.  My voice is not good enough  I don’t have a professional microphone.  There is so much noise around me  I don’t know x language  My product is for the opposite gender, so it will be better if a woman reads my script.  If any of those sound like you, we’re confident you’ll love MicMonster.\n                                 Step into the future of voice creation with a game-changing platform \n                                    MicMonster is a next-generation synthetic speech platform with natural-sounding AI voiceover and text-to-speech for e-learning, marketing, and entertainment.  All the other text-to-speech services are mainly used by TELEPHONE CENTRALS and there is absolutely no problem that they sound ROBOTIC! MicMonter is developed to create voiceovers. That’s why it not only sounds natural but also comes with voice styles such as cheerful, angry, sad, shouting, etc to create emotional voiceovers.\n                                 No More Robots Or Expensive Voice Over Actors! Here’s How To Use MicMonster Write or Paste your Text MicMonster knows how to pronounce all words, so whatever you enter will be read in a natural-sounding way. Select language & Voiceover MicMonster supports 140 languages, that’s why we provide a search feature. Search your favorite language and select the voiceover artist Choose voice style & Other customization Voices from the English (USA) and Chinese (Mandarin) have a variety of voice styles. Choose the voice Style & do other customization such as phoneme for words, custom pronunciation etc. Create & Download The last step is to hit the create button and download your voiceover file. \n                                Our Customers Use Micmonster for   Everything Voice Related Including:\n                             Everything Voice Related Including: \n                         Audiobooks Sales Videos Training Videos Educational Videos Explainer Videos Webinars How-To Videos Step-By-Step Guides Tutorials Demo Videos Event Videos Unboxing Videos Recipe Videos Documentories Comedy Skits Product Reviews Social Media Videos Video Adverts Case Studies and Testimonials Animations Presentations Motion Graphics Videos Typography Videos Screencast videos Podcasts Introduction Videos Teasers & Trailers Movies Giveaway and Contests Personalized Videos You'll Be Amazed By How Real It Sounds English (UK) English (USA) English (Australia) English (USA) English (USA) English (USA) Arabic (Algeria) Arabic (Iraq) English (USA) Chinese (China) French (Canada) French (France) German (Germany) Spanish (Spain) Spanish (USA) Chinese (China) Chinese (China) Chinese (China) Robotic Voices: What’s Thats? \n                                    None of the voices inside MicMonster sound robotic.   All our voices have elements that make a voice sound real and have all the expressions needed to make people more engaged in your content and sound professional!\n                                 \n                                Introducing Advanced Editor:   Take Your Voiceover To Next level\n                             Take Your Voiceover To Next level \n                             Control more prospects of voiceover with our advanced editor Want to Create dialogue audio, no worries inside the advanced editor you can assign specific words to any voice. With the Phoneme, you can customize words pronunciation Support Using the advanced editor you can control pitch, volume & speed for specific words of the script. Stress on words that are important to the context. You can draw graphs to customize how much stress you want to put on words. Works With Any Video Creation Platform Just create your voiceover with MicMonster, download the mp3, and import it into your favorite video editor. Make longer voiceover in Seconds! Forget the days when you have to wait for weeks for a Voiceover. MicMonster can create a 10 minutes voiceover in 10 seconds, check out how. MicMonster Unique feature Natural Sounding Other Text to speech tools are made for developers that’s why there is no problem in sounding robotic. We trained our voices to sound more natural just like a human voice. 500+ Voices With a growing library of 500+ voices, you can always find a voice that fits your needs. We have all kinds of male, female and child voices. Voice Styles Depending on the context, choose the voice style to keep your viewers engaged. MicMonster offers you a variety of styles such as sad, angry, cheerful, fearful, friendly, hopeful, etc. Advanced Editor Make next-level voiceover with the help of our advanced editor. From making conversational audio to customizing word pronunciation everything can be done by an advanced editor. 140 languages Including Popular Languages Multiple Accents Afrikaans (South Africa) – 2 Amharic (Ethiopia) – 2 Arabic – 4 Arabic (Algeria) – 2 Arabic (Bahrain) – 2 Arabic (Egypt) – 2 Arabic (Iraq) – 2 Arabic (Jordan) – 2 Arabic (Kuwait) – 2 Arabic (Libya) – 2 Arabic (Morocco) – 2 Arabic (Qatar) – 2 Arabic (Saudi Arabia) – 2 Arabic (Yemen) – 2 Bangla (Bangladesh) – 2 Bengali (India) – 3 Bulgarian (Bulgaria) – 2 Burmese (Myanmar) – 2 Catalan (Spain) – 3 Chinese (Cantonese, Traditional)- 3 Chinese (Mandarin, Simplified) – 18 Chinese (Taiwanese Mandarin) – 3 Croatian (Croatia) – 2 Czech (Czech) – 3 Danish (Denmark) – 6 Dutch (Belgium) – 4 Dutch (Netherlands) – 8 English (Australia) -6 English (Canada) – 2 English (Hongkong) – 2 English (India) - 6 English (Ireland) – 2 English (Kenya) – 2 English (New Zealand) – 2 English (Nigeria) – 2 English (Philippines) – 2 English (Singapore) – 2 English (South Africa) – 2 English (Tanzania) – 2 English (United Kingdom) – 20 English (United States) – 31 Estonian (Estonia) – 2 Filipino (Philippines) – 6 Finnish (Finland) - 4 French (Belgium) – 2 French (Canada) – 7 French (France) – 18 French (Switzerland) – 2 Galician (Spain) – 2 German (Austria) – 2 German (Germany) – 21 German (Switzerland) – 2 Greek (Greece) – 2 Gujarati (India) – 4 Hebrew (Israel) – 2 Hindi (India) – 6 Hungarian (Hungary) – 2 Icelandic (Iceland) – 2 Indonesian (Indonesia) – 6 Irish (Ireland) 