    "source": "https://www.useomnia.com",
    "content": "10x your AI visibility. Built for small marketing teams With Omnia you don't need to be a GEO expert to show up in AI search. Trusted by Not another GEO tool. A GEO hire Meet Omnio, the AI assistant within Omnia, does 95% of your GEO work. You orchestrate the other 5%. Improves your AI visibility Omnio prioritizes the moves with the most leverage, acts on them, and measures whether your visibility actually moved. With 3rd party outreach Omnio finds the sites worth pitching, drafts the emails, and can send them from your inbox, after you approve them. With new and existing content Omnio writes content in your tone of voice, rewrites the ones losing citations, and prepares them to be approved by you. While reporting on your AI visibility shifts Omnio analyzes how your visibility is changing across every major AI engine and reports back to you. Act on your AI visibility plan 10x faster from Claude or ChatGPT Connect Omnia to your favorite AI assistant Add the MCP to Claude, ChatGPT, or Cursor. Connecting is easy and only takes a minute. Put the agents to work Pull your share of voice across engines, analyze the citations, track new prompts, generate new insights. 10x your AI visibility Ship the work Omnia prioritizes, then track the lift across every AI engine. How it works Omnio discovers and diagnoses where you stand, comes up with an action plan, acts on it, and improves with each iteration. 1. Discover Omnio finds the prompts your buyers ask and checks how you show up. 2. Diagnose Omnio audits and analyzez your site along with every citation source it found. 3. Strategize Turn all findings into a roadmap to act on, ranked by impact. 4. Create Drafts or edit pages AI engines cite, each built to win a specific prompt. 5. Place Pitch publishers from your inbox to earn placements. 6. Measure Every move's impact is measured, reported on, and used for the next iteration. Showing up isn't enough. Find out on how AI talks about you See whether AI calls your pricing fair or expensive, your support fast or slow, feature by feature, against every competitor so you can catch a negative narrative before it spreads. And track how your visibility and sentiment evolve over time Monitor the prompts that matter across every major AI engine, daily. Share of voice, citations, and competitor benchmarks, in the countries and languages you sell in. “Omnia didn’t just show us data, it gave us direction. We know exactly where we can win and what to prioritize. We’re seeing more qualified leads come in from AI.” 10x your AI visibility without a GEO expert Frequently Asked Questions Omnia is an AI visibility platform that shows where and how your brand appears in AI search engines like ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Google AI mode. Unlike most AI visibility tools, Omnia also takes a step further and shows you how to act on your data to get featured in future AI answer. Omnia tracks major AI engines like ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, Google AI mode, Claude, Microsoft Copilot, and Gemini. Omnia tracks prompts every 24 hours so you can spot changes in AI as they happen. We have clients that see results in as little as 7 days, and use daily tracking to give you quick feedback loops to act on. Omnia runs prompts to find out and show you whether your brand is mentioned in AI answers, including how you benchmark against competitors. Omnia mimics real user behaviour to runs prompts that users type to learn about your category and product. SEO optimizes for clicks from search results. AEO optimizes for mentions and recommendations inside AI answers, often without a click. We’ve seen results in AEO in as little as 7 days with customers. Unlike SEO, which often takes months, AI visibility can be changed and influenced much more quickly.",
    "source_matches_official_url": true
  },
