    "content": "Bills saved by negotiation 20% Pine reduces telecom and cable bills by 20% on average Common problems Pine AI can solve David recovered 100,000 Marriott Bonvoy points worth $700. Mike recovered a $96 refund from DoorDash and cancelled his subscription. Brian cancelled five American Express corporate cards and eliminated the annual fees. Ryan saved $300 a year on his Xfinity bill and got his internet speed upgraded to 1Gbps. Jessica resolved a delivery issue with USPS and saved 56 minutes on the phone. Sarah cancelled her Netflix subscription and confirmed no future charges. Emily secured a dinner reservation on a packed NFL game day. Rachel had Pine attend her vendor Google Meet and ask her 10 prepared questions, saving her from sitting through the call. Amy got a $35 late fee waived on her electricity bill. Chris reduced his monthly expenses by $90 by cancelling a forgotten subscription. Kevin recovered $135 from Hertz after an overcharge on his rental. Worn down by long hold times, endless transfers, and unhelpful agents, you eventually give up on fighting for what's rightfully yours. Now Pine is here to help. Get started $50 Pine often makes hotels and airlines offer up to $50 in compensation for complaints All your data stays safe and fully encrypted, accessible only by you. For the call, we use only the essentials, temporarily and with approval. Learn More Choose a subscription, get credits every month, and spend them on the life admin work Pine executes for you. Monthly credits Your subscription refreshes with credits each month, so Pine can keep handling tasks as they come up. Calls, emails, follow-ups Use credits for calls, forms, refunds, disputes, research, and follow-up work until the task is done. Annual plan advantage Annual plans run bill negotiation with credits only, with no percentage success fee. Grealish Morvan Life admin I got this because I was absolutely not in the mood to deal with a billing mess myself. It took one of those tasks I keep pushing off and made it feel smaller. Rowshon Kulsom Bill issue I had a phone bill issue sitting there for way too long. Pine helped make the whole thing feel much more manageable, which is really all I wanted. Lacey Kristen Support tasks The app solved a very specific annoyance I had been avoiding. Sometimes it is just not wanting to spend your time on something irritating. David Ortega Bills and refunds Pine handled things I had been putting off for months without me lifting a finger. It pushed back on my bills and fees and actually got money refunded. Elaine Shelton Daily tasks It has been a huge help in my day-to-day life, especially things like making calls, dealing with customer service, or managing small errands. Lavender Jones AI calls It has an AI agent that will make calls for you, as well as help you find hidden fees on your bills. Pretty awesome and it actually works. Alesha Quibodeaux Utility bill I submitted a photo of my electric bill and Pine gave me thoughtful responses, then offered to help call my utility company about ways to lower it. Rosa Vasquez Travel planning I was looking for help with my travel plans and budget, and Pine AI did a fantastic job figuring this all out for me. The app ran smoothly. Jason Didio Boring tasks It is a nifty and useful app that lets you choose an AI to handle the boring stuff for you, like phone calls or reminders for appointments. Shane Mckay Everyday use Pine has been a great experience so far. It feels fast, simple, and easy to use, and the responses are clear and helpful without feeling cluttered. Tell Pine what you need — it handles the calls, emails, and follow-ups for you. Try for free",
