    "content": "Quetext has been a lifesaver during finals season. I can submit assignments knowing my citations are correct and my work is fully original. The confidence score breakdown makes it easy to fix flagged sections before I hand anything in. I've recommended Quetext to my entire department. The bulk upload feature and the ability to add remarks directly on submissions has streamlined my review process significantly. It's the most practical tool I've found for maintaining academic integrity at scale. In an industry where originality is everything, Quetext gives our team peace of mind. We run every blog post and campaign copy through it before publishing. The Professional plan's word-based pricing means we only pay for what we use, which is a huge win for a growing team. Quetext Essential plan is intended for individuals like students, teachers and copywriters who need robust features to help them ensure originality of content, improve their writing and build grammatically correct citations, all on a smaller scale. Quetext’s Professional plan is designed for larger teams and organizations looking for robust features in a scalable secure global platform that offers a word-based pricing rather than user-based pricing, allowing for greater flexibility. The Professional plan also includes additional features like remarks and the ability to bulk upload up to 100 files at once, compared to the 20-file limit in the Essential plan. We take platform security seriously. We utilize the latest technology, including multi-factor authentication techniques, to ensure your account and data are secure. In addition, all sensitive/credit information you supply is encrypted via Secure Socket Layer (SSL) technology. We continuously review and test our platforms so you and your organization can work with confidence. All financial transactions are processed through a leading global gateway provider and are not stored or processed on our servers. Visit our Privacy Policy Page for more information! Yes! Our Professional subscription plan allow subscribers to add unlimited users. Please contact support [email protected] if you need a plan with more than 150 users. If you exceed the number of words allotted in your plan, you can purchase additional words to complete a search by visiting your subscription page , or you can upgrade to an Professional plan and select the number of words you’d like to purchase. Yes, you can upgrade, downgrade, or change your subscription plan at any time. Simply log into your account, navigate to your subscription page, and click “upgrade plan”. Any changes made to your subscription will be reflected in your next billing cycle. Yes! By bundling different tools such as the Plagiarism Checker and AITutorMe, you can save significantly on your subscription compared to purchasing tools individually. Check out the pricing page for more details on bundle options and discounts. Currently, our payment processor accepts credit and debits cards issues by the following card networks: Visa, MasterCard American Express, Discover, Diners Club, Google Pay or JCB. Yes, Quetext is designed to support writers at all proficiency levels. Our grammar checker helps non-native English speakers identify errors, refine phrasing, and strengthen their writing, making it a valuable companion for academic and professional work alike. Additionally, we also provide our tools in 12 different languages. Quetext uses DeepSearch® technology, which cross-references your content against billions of web pages, academic papers, and published works to deliver highly accurate results. Match confidence scores help you quickly distinguish between incidental phrasing similarities and actual plagiarism concerns. Yes, Quetext offers a free plan so you can explore the platform before upgrading. The free plan gives you access to core Plagiarism Checker, AI Detector, AI Humanizer, AI Summarizer, and Citation Generator with a limited word count, so you can get a feel for the experience before choosing the plan that fits your needs. Please visit our Help Center page for answers to more common questions.",
