 are no second takes in moments like these. Top performers prepare for that kind of pressure by rehearsing. Obsessively. We built RehearseNow for exactly that. It's a simple tool with cutting-edge tech under the hood. It's designed to help you focus, get more takes in, and deliver the performance of a lifetime. We invite you to experience the new standard in AI-assisted rehearsing, whether you're an actor, keynote speaker, or business leader. Stop waiting for someone to read lines with. RehearseNow parses your script and responds right on cue, listening to your pacing until every line is locked in. Practice your pauses, punchlines, and pacing against a system that never gets tired. Build muscle memory until your timing is second nature. Upload your talking points for any critical presentation. Our AI acts as your active listener, letting you run your pitch until you know the material cold. Save with annual — $140/yr (vs $180 billed monthly).",
