hat the SEO spend bought, you have an answer. Every win is measured against a holdout of untouched pages, and you see which AI citations turned into leads. If a lift cannot survive that, we say so. Share a report your board can read without you. By default, nothing goes live until you approve it. Checkout, pricing and legal pages stay locked. A page your team edits mid-run is handed back, harmful changes are reversed or flagged, and everything publishes to your CMS, so the work stays yours. Every change is explainable, reviewable, and reversible. Connect your site. We'll find your first 10 opportunities for free. Agents deliver brand-safe, high-quality work at scale, so results keep compounding. Agents track where you get cited in ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity and AI Overviews, then build the content that earns citations. Agents edit the pages you already have in WordPress, Webflow, Shopify, HubSpot and 14 more. No migration, no dev ticket. Approve every move, or let agents run unattended. QA blocks off-brand claims, money pages stay locked, any edit undone in a click. Agents read your Search Console data and rank every fix by what it is worth. You get a short list, not a 200-row audit. Every task is measured against a holdout of untouched pages, so you see what the work earned, not the season. Losses included. Agents run multi-step campaigns and ship bulk changes in verified waves. Every Monday the plan is rewritten against real results. ONE PLATFORM, NOT TEN TOOLS One connection, one subscription from $99/mo. A team of agents doing the work your whole SEO stack used to. +2 hours reviewing Search Console, finding opportunities +2 hours deciding what's worth doing this month +8 hours writing and optimizing content +3 hours titles, meta, schema, internal links +2 hours publishing and formatting in the CMS +2 hours building the report +1 hour explaining what moved and why = 200 hours every month Hours of your time +5 min connect Search Console and your CMS (one-time) +0