g as your subscription stays active. Credits don't roll over on the free tier. If you cancel your subscription, unused credits expire at the end of your billing cycle. How can I change or cancel my plan? You can upgrade, downgrade or cancel at any time. Upon cancellation, your subscription and credits remain active until the end of the current billing cycle. If my plan ends, will I still be able to use my credits? Yes, until your current billing cycle ends. After that, unused credits expire. How long can my videos be? You can create videos from 15s up to 10 minutes long. Is there a free trial for the app? Yes. Create an account and get free credits to generate a few videos before you buy. How can I contact support? If you have any questions, feedback, or experience technical issues, please reach out to our support team at contact@virvid.ai. We're always here to help, and your feedback helps us improve the product for everyone. Can I use the videos anywhere? Absolutely. You own all of your creatives, even after your plan ends, and can use them across any channel without restrictions (e.g. TikTok, Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts). How often is Virvid updated? Constantly. We push daily improvements, weekly features, and continuously refresh video styles and formats to follow the latest trends. We prioritize user feedback to shape the product - if you have any feature ideas or suggestions, reach out to us at contact@virvid.ai. Your input directly influences what we build next.",
