ded. Marty Englander Marketer I think SiteSpeak is a super easy and extremely powerful tool to start installing into your website. 7-day free trial Everything you need to know about SiteSpeakAI. Can't find what you're looking for? Start a free trial and see it in action. Training starts as soon as you add your first source. Most websites finish indexing within a few minutes. Larger sites with hundreds of pages take longer, but content becomes available as soon as the first pages are crawled. You set a default response so the AI never makes things up when it's unsure. You can also configure it to hand the conversation off to your team or capture the visitor's contact details for follow-up. Your content and conversations are stored on secure servers and we don't sell your data. AI providers like OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google process queries to generate replies. See our Privacy Policy for the full breakdown. Yes. Your AI agent automatically detects the visitor's language and replies in their language. 95+ languages are supported out of the box, including Spanish, French, German, Portuguese, Japanese, Chinese, and Arabic. Yes. Customize colors, logo, welcome message, suggested questions, and the AI's personality. Connect to your CRM, helpdesk, calendar, and any REST API or MCP server so the agent can take real actions, not just answer questions. Each AI reply to a visitor counts as one message credit. The free plan includes 30 credits per month and paid plans start at 1,000 credits. All paid plans come with a 7-day free trial and you only need a credit card after the trial ends. Yes. Cancel from your billing settings at any time and you keep access until the end of your billing period. Join 1,000+ businesses across SaaS, e-commerce, and agencies automating their customer service and other tasks with a custom-trained AI agent.",
