rust. Content creators Create clearer, better-connected content that answer engines can retrieve and cite. SEO professionals Extend your existing retrieval work into AEO, GEO and measurable AI traffic. Agencies Add GEO services to client sites without forcing everyone to replace their SEO plugin. Developers Implement indexing, structured data, AI files and architecture in one WordPress workflow. Credibility Built by AI marketing pioneers. Not a weekend AI wrapper. Built on more than 13 years of SEO, content, structured data, indexing, research and AI marketing systems. This is the evolution of a platform used by tens of thousands of paying businesses — not an experimental plugin assembled after the AI boom. 29 software products launched 25,000+ paying clients Millions of plugin installs 2013 profitable since 2010 AI marketing innovation since Frequently asked questions \n\t\t\t\t\t  What is a GEO plugin for WordPress?  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t What is a GEO plugin for WordPress? \n\t\t\t\t A GEO plugin helps make WordPress content easier for generative AI and answer engines to retrieve, understand, evaluate, cite and recommend. \n\t\t\t\t\t  Does GEO Plugin by Squirrly SEO replace my SEO plugin?  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Does GEO Plugin by Squirrly SEO replace my SEO plugin? \n\t\t\t\t It can provide complete Holistic SEO, but replacement is not required. It can run alongside Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress and other plugins using No Configuration mode. \n\t\t\t\t\t  Do I still need SEO for GEO?  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Do I still need SEO for GEO? \n\t\t\t\t Yes. SEO helps content become crawlable, indexed, relevant and retrievable. GEO builds on that foundation by improving how AI systems understand and evaluate the brand. \n\t\t\t\t\t  Can the plugin guarantee that ChatGPT will recommend my brand?  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Can the plugin guarantee t