 numbers — on schedule, and drops a daily business pulse in Slack every morning. It enriches new leads straight into your CRM, and scans ledgers for duplicate charges and wrong bills — flagged to you, never \"fixed\" silently. Are you a VA or an EA? I know this page says that we can replace you — however, we work best WITH you. A personal note from the founder I spent years building automated workflows for high-growth businesses. Every single week, I noticed the same pattern: business owners were drowning in software dashboards, or spending thousands of dollars managing virtual assistants just to keep up with basic tasks. ChatGPT was supposed to fix this, but it just gave us more homework. It told us what to do, but we still had to log in, export the data, draft the copy, and build the emails ourselves. I built Sterling because I wanted an employee, not an advisor. I wanted something that lives where my team already works (Slack), connects directly to our business stack, and actually finishes the task on day one. No training manuals, no timezone delays, and no micromanagement. If you're tired of babysitting your software and your staff, give Sterling one real job. Your first 20,000 credits are on me — and they run on your real store, not a demo. Allen Brouwer Founder, sterlingcoworker.com No hire, no per-seat math, no surprise invoice. Here's the whole price, and you can do it in your head. $50 a month = 20,000 credits for your whole workspace. Your first 20,000 are free. Pause or cancel anytime from the dashboard. Team Workspace Access Get started for 20,000 credits included — a $50 value. No card required. What 20,000 credits gets you each month: Nobody buys credits. They buy finished Mondays. Free to prove on your own store. Your first 20,000 credits are free and run on your real store — no card. Put Sterling on the weekly audit, the one job you know exactly how long it takes you by hand. Sterling alerts you at 80%, and if credits run out it pauses until you top up or the new month lands. If the finished report isn't worth $50 a month to you, walk away having spent an afternoon and $0. Everything you need to feel confident hiring Sterling You’ve read how it works. Here’s the only move left. The weekly audit — the one you could time by hand. Hand it over and watch the loop run on your own store. Your first 20,000 credits are free, no card to enter, and they run on your real store, not a demo. If the finished report isn't worth $50 a month to you, you've spent an afternoon and $0. Add Sterling to My Slack — 20,000 Credits Free P.S. Every tool on the market promises to \"do the work.\" Here's the line that matters when it's your store, your list, and your ad account on the line: Sterling does everything up to the send. The send is yours. It drafts, builds, reconciles, and reports on its own — then stops and waits for one word from you before anything reaches a customer, costs a dollar, or can't be undone. Start free with 20,000 credits and put it on one real job. Worst case, you got a free audit of your own store.",
