    "content": "What do you like best about Synthesia? How easy it is to use and get started! The platform is user friendly - anyone can do it! It's also very easy to download and upload the videos into an LMS or other video hosting platform. One of 2,000+ 5-star reviews on All-in-one AI Video platform for business Create studio-quality videos with AI avatars and voiceovers in 160+ languages. Save up to 90% of time and cost on video production. No credit card required Trusted by over 90% of Fortune 100 companies Train, market and sell like a Fortune 100 company One platform to create, localize, manage and publish AI videos Create your own expressive AI Avatar Your AI Avatar speaks 160+ languages, fluently, and with uncanny expressiveness. And yes, you keep full control over it. Turn any content into AI videos, instantly Automatically transform your existing documents, links, or ideas into AI videos that match your brand style. Collaborate with your team in real time Create, collaborate, comment and review AI videos in real-time. All in one place. Create polished screen recordings in one take Instant transcripts without 'ums' or 'uhs'. Edit, update and translate instantly. Watch all your videos in one multilingual player Watch, organize and access all 160+ languages in a single player. We are processing your submission. You will now be redirected. Loved by users. Approved by legal. Signed off by CFOs No video editing skills or equipment required. 90% of users publish their first video without needing a tutorial. And if you want to go deeper, there's a whole Academy. SOC2. GDPR. ISO42001. SAML/SSO. Locked down. Passed ironclad compliance audits at 90% of the Fortune 100. Built to satisfy the toughest legal and security teams. One budget, one login. No extra tools. No agencies. Your entire video workflow on one platform. Create, localize, manage, and publish AI videos at scale.  Get the skills, insights, and support to help you scale You’ve likely got a few questions Is Synthesia free? We have a free plan that lets you create free AI videos! It includes 10 minutes of video per month, 9 stock avatars and a full range of AI voices in 160+ languages. Learn more about all available plans or try our free AI video generator. Can I customize AI videos to add brand identity? Yes, you can easily create AI videos with branded backgrounds, colors and logos. You can also customize your AI avatars by changing their clothing and adding logos and your brand colours. Does AI video creation integrate with existing LMS? Synthesia's AI video generator is designed to integrate effortlessly with your existing Learning Management System (LMS), ensuring a smooth and efficient workflow. You can create AI videos and directly embed them into your courses and training modules. This seamless integration streamlines the process of updating and distributing training materials. See the full list of integrations. How does AI video creation improve employee productivity? AI videos created with Synthesia allow companies to be agile and consistent in all types of internal communications and training. It is an engaging format that can be easily updated, translated and customised which all in all fosters a more informed, skilled, and motivated workforce, driving the success of the organization's learning initiatives and productivity. Is it safe for businesses to create AI videos in Synthesia? Synthesia provides a secure environment for businesses, ensuring your company's data is safe and under your control. Synthesia is SOC 2 Type II & GDPR compliant and has a team to keep your data safe. The integration of both human and AI moderation processes, along with proactive engagement in AI policy, ensures the ethical and responsible use of AI in video generation. Read more about our ethics policy. What can you do with Synthesia's AI video tools? With Synthesia, you can effortlessly create professional-quality videos without the challenges of filming and production. Here are a few examples of what you can do: Add AI Avatars: Choose from a diverse selection of AI avatars to make your videos more engaging and inclusive. Create Instant Voiceovers: Convert your scripts into high-quality voiceovers in hundreds of natural-sounding AI voices. Edit Videos: Use pre-designed templates and AI assistance to transform PowerPoints, documents, PDFs, website links or ideas into polished videos. Team Collaboration: Work together in real-time and manage projects in shared workspaces. Translate and localize in 1 click: Automatically translate videos into 160+ languages to reach your audience worldwide. This tool is especially useful for creating training videos, marketing content, and customer service videos, helping you streamline and enhance your video production process.",
