    "content": "AI T-shirt design generator built for designers and creators. Turn a prompt or a reference image into print-ready artwork, previewed live on the shirt — in about a minute. Free trial: first design + print file after Google sign-in. Free design + print file on sign-in·Live tee preview·300 DPI print-ready PNG Bold graphic Line art Vintage ● ready Live Generator AI T-Shirt Design Generator · Free Trial. Describe the design, pick a style, and the artwork lands on a live tee on the right — switch garment and color anytime. Your draft is saved even through sign-in. Preview updates live — the sample is replaced by your design after generation. Examples · 4 styles, one tool AI Generated Tee Designs · 4 Styles, One Prompt Box. Each example is a real output from this AI t-shirt design generator, made from a single text prompt — different subjects, different drawing styles, same tool. \"Snow leopard in circuit lines, high contrast, chest print\" Line art Line art tee \"One-line botanical face, minimal, single stroke\" Vintage Vintage tee \"Retro sunset over mountains, screen-print texture, 70s palette\" Typography Typography tee \"Bold stacked slogan, condensed grotesque, one accent line\" How it works From a Sentence to a Shirt in Three Steps. The AI t-shirt design generator needs no design software, no mockup templates, and no learning curve. Step 01 Describe the Design in Plain English Type one sentence: subject, style, mood, slogan. Or start from an example and tweak — the prompt box does the rest. Drop a reference image to lock a style. Step 02 AI Generates, You Preview It Live A polished design in 60–90 seconds. It lands on a live tee preview — switch garment type and color in the browser until it looks right. Step 03 Download Print-ready Files Export a transparent 300 DPI PNG at 4500×5400 — sized for DTG and screen print. No watermark, commercial use included on paid plans. Features What the AI T-Shirt Design Generator Can Actually Do. Six things the generator does well today — no inflated claims, no placeholder roadmap. Just a fast tool built for real production. Plain-English Prompts No design vocabulary needed. Describe the idea and the AI handles composition, accurate slogan text, and clean edges ready for background removal. Live Tee Preview Every result lands directly on the shirt. Switch between 6 garment types and 12 garment colors instantly, all in the browser. 9 Art Styles + 6 Garments Vintage, bold typography, cartoon mascot, line art, grunge streetwear, kawaii, emblem badge, watercolor and more — previewed on crew, v-neck, tank, long sleeve, raglan and women's fit. Image-to-Image References Upload a reference image — a sketch, a moodboard frame, an old print — and the generator restyles the artwork while keeping your idea. Free Trial, Then Pay As You Go Your first design and its print-ready file are free after Google sign-in. Then $19/mo for 300 credits, or a one-time top-up that never expires. Private by Default Your prompts, references and generated designs stay yours. We don't train on your work and never share your inputs. Built for Who Uses the AI T-Shirt Design Generator. Three audiences, one tool. Whether you concept for clients, drop merch, or fill a POD catalog, the generator fits in. Designers Concept 10 Directions Before Lunch. Explore styles and compositions in minutes, then take the best one into your own tools — export transparent, print-ready, at 300 DPI. —Style-consistent output from one prompt —Transparent PNG for your own pipeline —Reference upload keeps your visual language Creators & Brands Merch Drops Without a Design Budget. Describe the drop in one sentence and get print-ready art for your store — with a live shirt preview for the product page. —Print-ready PNG for DTG and screen print —Live tee preview · 6 garments, 12 colors —Commercial use on paid plans Print Shops & POD Sellers A Catalog Page a Day, Not a Week. Batch out seasonal designs for print-on-demand catalogs. Consistent sizing, safe margins, and files your workflow accepts. —Correct DPI and margins out of the box —Batch mode in Studio — up to 20 designs per run —Top-up credits never expire Pricing AI T-Shirt Design Generator Pricing. Start Free. Pick a plan that fits your usage. Yearly grants all credits upfront — no monthly cap. One-time top-ups never expire. MonthlyYearlycredits upfrontOne-time Free $0forever 2 credits on signup Try the full loop — design and print file included. First design + its print-ready file free All 9 art styles Live tee preview · 6 garments, 12 colors Watermark-free preview download Sign in free MOST POPULAR Pro $19/ month 300 credits / month For designers and creators shipping designs weekly. Print-ready export · 300 DPI transparent PNG Sized for DTG and screen print (4500×5400) Image-to-image with a reference upload Batch mode · up to 20 designs per run Personal & commercial use Sign in to subscribe Team $59/ month 1500 credits / month For POD sellers and print shops producing daily. Everything in Pro Batch mode · up to 50 designs per run Bulk print-ready export · ZIP + manifest CSV Priority support Sign in to subscribe FAQ Frequently Asked Questions. Common questions about the AI t-shirt design generator — print quality, formats, rights and privacy. What is Tshirt Design AI? Tshirt Design AI is an AI t-shirt design generator: it turns a text prompt or a reference image into T-shirt artwork, previews it live on a shirt you can restyle in the browser (6 garment types, 12 colors), and exports print-ready files — a transparent 300 DPI PNG at 4500×5400. Google sign-in is required; signup includes 2 free credits — your first design and its print-ready file. Are the files really print-ready? Can I edit the generated design? Do I own the designs? Can I sell them? Do you train AI models on my designs? Can I generate t-shirt designs in bulk? Ready when you are Generate Your First Tee Design. Describe the idea and let the AI t-shirt design generator do the rest — print-ready artwork on a live shirt preview in about a minute. Google sign-in required, 1 design free, no card needed.",
