    "content": "Tabnine is a fully private, organization-aware AI coding platform designed to run entirely within your environment—from IDE to CLI. It connects to your repositories and development systems to deliver real-time, secure code assistance and automated workflows across the software lifecycle. Tabnine is a fully private, organization-aware AI coding platform designed to run entirely within your environment—from IDE to CLI. It connects to your repositories and development systems to deliver real-time, secure code assistance and automated workflows across the software lifecycle. Supercharge your AI with MCP With full MCP support, Tabnine agents can securely connect to the tools and data that power your software development lifecycle. MCP provides a unified, governed interface that lets agents read Jira tickets, analyze logs, pull documentation, and call approved services — without brittle integrations or security gaps. Steerable AI with Flexible Model Choice Pick the right model for each use case — leading frontier models or OSS — then steer its behavior with guardrails, prompts, and team-level preferences. Tabnine gives engineering organizations full control over how AI reasons, responds, and writes code. AI That Accelerates Real Development Work Tabnine brings practical, developer-first AI directly into your workflow—across your IDE and CLI. It generates code, completes functions, explains complex logic, and refactors existing code. From fixing bugs to writing tests and documentation, Tabnine automates the repetitive work so your team can focus on building what matters. Watch Tabnine bring a feature to life Watch Tabnine take a feature from JIRA ticket to working code — analyzing the issue, proposing the fix, and implementing it. Enterprise Context for Smarter Agents Tabnine’s Enterprise Context Engine is what makes AI coding truly enterprise-ready. Instead of guessing from generic training data, it learns your organization’s unique architecture, frameworks, and coding standards. It adapts to your mixed stacks and legacy systems, ensuring every suggestion aligns with your security, compliance, and performance requirements. By embedding enterprise knowledge directly into the coding experience, Tabnine transforms AI from a novelty into a governed, context-aware teammate that codes the way your enterprise works. Built for Mission-Critical and Highly Secure Environments Deploy anywhere — SaaS, on-prem, or fully air-gapped — and keep everything inside. Tabnine gives mission-critical teams the control and compliance to scale AI securely across the enterprise. Your AI control plane for trusted software development. Tabnine gives you centralized visibility, granular access controls, policy enforcement, and full auditability across users, teams, and workspaces — all in one secure place. Learn why millions of developers choose Tabnine and why Tabnine is a 2026 Gartner Magic Quadrant Visionary.",
