ed lessons, conversation practice, and support for 122 dialects. Voice Conversations Have engaging voice conversations with our AI tutors Feedback Get instant feedback on your language skills, and tips on how to improve Wordbook Save and revisit words learned during training to strengthen your vocabulary over time. Pronunciation Assess and practice your pronunciation with word-by-word feedback Streaks Keep track of your progress with streaks to built a habit of learning Progress Track your progress and get weekly reports on your language learning journey Recognized in Academic Research Talkio is recommended for its language learning efficiency in peer-reviewed journals, conference papers, and institutional reports from universities and research organizations worldwide. View publications What Our Students Say Real stories from real users of Talkio 4.8 Our average rating is based on verified reviews from Senja, TinyAsk, Trustpilot and Product Hunt. 5.0 This tool is awesome Jose Luis Verified Spanish 5.0 I am very happy with this app! This is what I was looking for! I like the speed of the app and the possibilities it provides. 5 stars! Alina Verified Russian 5.0 This tool Talkio.ai is blowing my mind for language learning - it's related to Voice Control for ChatGPT, which you should also try! Practice your foreign language speaking skills by having a chat with an AI. Mark DeLoura Verified French 5.0 Talkio is so awesome!! I can practice my spanish skills whenever and whereever possible. I'm able to talk about different subjects and work on my vocabulary and grammar structure. Talkio is THE BEST!!! Andrew Ross Verified Spanish 5.0 Talkio is an amazing tool. I can't believe I can practice all of the languages I want to whenever I want. It is such a useful AI tool. You can practice speaking and listening which usually isn't possible with a language learning tool. Conor Monaghan Verified English 5.0 Have been trying out Talkio the last couple of days practicing my speakin