 core systems that connect paid marketing to revenue, in one managed program. One team runs the work included in your plan on a connected WebFX platform, so campaign execution, lead data, and specialist review stay in one operating system. Get found Paid local visibility through Google Ads and Google Local Services Ads where applicable. Organic local SEO, listings management, and Maps ranking work remain WebFX Platform scope. Get chosen Google Ads on every plan, paid social on Growth and Scale, and AdTechFX options such as CTV, geofencing, and programmatic on eligible Growth and Scale programs. Get converted Agents surface conversion barriers in your funnel and landing pages. Scale adds CRO diagnosis and lightweight tests. Major site and CRO programs move to the WebFX Platform when that is the honest fit. Get credited RevenueCloudFX channel-level lead attribution and 10 Nutshell Professional seats are included on every plan, so campaign and pipeline data can be reviewed together. What a Growth Loop actually is. We run the campaigns, connect campaign and lead data, and use the results to improve the next cycle. Each turn gives the agents and specialist more account context for the decisions that follow. We optimize to customers, not clicks. DRIVE describes the feedback cycle behind the managed program: connect the data, align activity to revenue, surface insights, focus on value, and improve the next execution cycle. Data Backbone We connect the campaign, lead, and pipeline data included in your plan, so you can see what is driving cost per lead and revenue. Revenue Alignment Where the plan and platform support it, we send qualified conversion signals back to eligible ad platforms to improve optimization. Insights Engine Agents surface patterns and opportunities as results arrive. FXIndustry context is refreshed quarterly by Revenue Marketing Specialists. Value Focus We rank channels by real customer value and shift budget toward the ones that bring buyers. Execute & Elevate Agents keep working as results flow back, with specialist review and communication cadence that steps up by plan. You do not have to choose. Most buyers pick two: an expert who knows the industry, decades of proven practice, or genuinely current AI. Growth Loops is all three, on one team, for one published price. An expert who knows your industry A named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist supported by WebFX campaign history and FXIndustry context for your vertical. 30 years of what actually worked $10B+ in revenue driven and 3.2M+ hours of validated work, filtered down to the plays that apply to a business like yours. Current AI accelerating the work TeamAI agents running research, creative, bidding, routing and reporting every day, on infrastructure WebFX owns. Put together, the system connects execution, intelligence, attribution, and specialist judgment. Every plan includes the core Growth Loops stack; channel depth, CRO support, and specialist cadence step up by tier. The connected systems your plan brings together. Connected conversion data can help eligible ad platforms optimize toward stronger customer signals. One team runs the systems and channels included in your plan. A clear view of what changed and what to do next. This illustrative dashboard shows how campaign, lead, and pipeline signals can be brought together. Actual reporting reflects the channels and data connected to your plan. Decades of validated marketing. Enterprise AI built to run it. WebFX brings published results across paid media, SEO, local search, and AI visibility from 30+ years in marketing. These examples show WebFX’s broader track record; they do not define what is included in every Growth Loops plan. TeamAI brings the enterprise AI platform where agent teams execute at scale. Growth Loops brings those systems together for managed revenue marketing. Bruni & Campisi 321% more goal completions Read the case study on webfx.com → Hurst Pediatric Dentistry 540% more organic leads Read the case study on webfx.com → Thompson Tractor 10/10 tracked LLMs citing them Read the case study on webfx.com → Published WebFX client results. WebFX delivered the paid, SEO, local-search, and AI-visibility programs linked above. These examples establish the broader WebFX track record; Growth Loops does not claim these outcomes as past delivery for those clients or imply every service is included in a Growth Loops plan. Case metrics shown with client consent for marketing. No personal client data is used to train AI models. GPT, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, LLaMA, and others. Agent execution layer for Growth Loops workflows. Growth Loops is where WebFX’s validated marketing leadership and TeamAI’s enterprise agent platform come together as one offer. What follows is how that partnership runs for your business. See how Growth Loops works. A quick look at how always-on AI agent execution and human accountability work together to keep revenue growing. Always-on execution. Named specialist accountability. Always-on agents handle planning, research, and campaign work. One named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist directs the program, reviews recommendations, and stays accountable on the cadence included with your plan. ALWAYS-ON AGENT EXECUTION TeamAI agents run the work all month Research your market and competitors so campaigns start with real context Draft and test ad copy and creative across Google Ads and paid social Tune paid campaigns daily (bids, budgets, and what’s running) Spot what’s blocking leads on your site and landing pages Report on results and rank leads so you know what’s working SPECIALIST ACCOUNTABILITY A named specialist directs your managed program Uses WebFX campaign history and FXIndustry context for your vertical Reviews work according to the cadence included in your plan Curates what the FXBrain remembers Carries the judgment the AI cannot Explains the rationale behind each recommendation The accountability standard differs by tier Same core stack in every tier. Channel scope, talk time, and sign-off cadence step up by plan. A Marketing Specialist directs the work and stays accountable for what ships. A Marketing Specialist directs the work and stays accountable for what ships. A Marketing Specialist directs the work and stays accountable for what ships. An agent team that accelerates the work. Function-driven roles you would actually hire for. Each agent uses FXIndustry and FXClient context, while a named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist directs the managed program and stays accountable for the recommendations. The five in every plan Starter · Growth · Scale Two more join at Growth Growth · Scale Two more join at Scale Scale It already knows your business. Every new hire and agency spends months learning your business. This already knows it. 30+ years of validated work, drawn from 3.2M+ hours of WebFX marketing expertise and more than $10B in client revenue driven. Benchmarks, sales-cycle patterns, and channel-mix norms for your industry. Compounds as campaign, lead, and account results are added, with curation cadence set by plan. Three questions you’re already asking “What works across revenue marketing in general?” FXBrain: Cross-vertical patterns informed by over $10B in revenue driven for clients. “What works in my vertical right now?” FXIndustry Brain: Your vertical’s benchmarks, refreshed quarterly by Revenue Marketing Specialists. “What’s working for me specifically?” FXClient Brain: Your account’s compounded learning, curated by your Revenue Marketing Specialist. And the quiet one, “Can I stand behind what the AI recommends?”, is answered by the model below. \n Generic AI reasons from the internet. WebFX AI reasons from 3.2+ million hours of expertise. The connected stack your agents run on, already built. Most AI tools are just the agents. Growth Loops includes CRM, connected data, and AI search on platform WebFX owns and wires together, so you are not buying and connecting multiple tools yourself. Role in Growth Loops Your Revenue Marketing Specialist The accountability layer. One named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist directs the managed program, uses FXIndustry context for your vertical, reviews agent recommendations, meets you on the schedule included with your plan, and tells you plainly what is working. The job it owns Always-on agents handle recurring marketing tasks. Your specialist reviews recommendations according to the cadence and sign-off standard included with your tier, so accountability remains clear as operating depth increases. Scheduled calls with you: monthly on Starter, every two weeks on Growth, weekly on Scale. Without a named specialist in the loop, this would be generic software, not the WebFX product. Role in Growth Loops FXBrain The intelligence layer underneath the agents. Three nested knowledge layers (cross-industry (FXBrain), your vertical (FXIndustry), and your account (FXClient)) that agents use when producing recommendations. Every pattern is curated by a WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist before any agent reads from it. The job it owns Your AI starts knowing what works in your industry instead of guessing from the internet. Patterns come from real WebFX campaign work since 1995, curated by specialists, not scraped from the open web. Agents accelerate the work. Revenue Marketing Specialists apply judgment, review recommendations, and direct the program according to the plan’s operating cadence. Role in Growth Loops OmniSEO WebFX’s trademarked strategy for visibility across ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Google’s AI Overviews. Inside Growth Loops, OmniSEO shows up as AI search visibility diagnosis: where you stand, where competitors get cited, and what to change. The job it owns See whether buyers asking ChatGPT or Google’s AI get pointed to you, or to your competitor. Growth Loops diagnoses citation gaps and recommends content and structured-data fixes; large-scale OmniSEO execution (the full program) is a WebFX Platform engagement when the gap needs more than diagnosis. Diagnosis lives here. Your Revenue Marketing Specialist tells you when a Platform upgrade (or your in-house team) is the better next step. Role in Growth Loops TeamAI The agentic infrastructure: the runtime behind every Growth Loops agent. A TeamAI agent team does the day-to-day work: paid channels, creative variants, lead routing, attribution, and the campaign and analysis work included in your plan. The job it owns The place your agent team actually runs. You don’t stand up any AI infrastructure yourself. Agents work inside a specialist-directed program on one system, so findings land beside your attribution and pipeline instead of in a separate tool you have to reconcile. Every tier ships with a TeamAI agent team doing the work and a WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist accountable for the result. Role in Growth Loops Nutshell The CRM Growth Loops standardizes on. Nutshell (acquired by WebFX in 2022) is where leads, ownership, routing, and pipeline live. Every plan includes 10 Nutshell Professional seats. The job it owns Leads and pipeline finally live in one place your sales team actually opens. Those seats are what make attribution back to closed-won deals possible instead of stopping at the form fill. On another CRM today? That’s an honest conversation: migrate to Nutshell, or a WebFX Platform engagement with broader connectors. Growth Loops runs on Nutshell. Platform meets your stack where it is when Nutshell isn’t the fit. Role in Growth Loops RevenueCloudFX The marketing data layer WebFX built and has run for 20+ years: structured campaign and attribution data that agents and your Revenue Marketing Specialist check numbers against. The job it owns See which spend actually made money, not just clicks. Pipeline and attribution context from RevenueCloudFX (with Nutshell) so a vanity signal (a citation, a lead, a channel spike) gets weighed against what drives revenue. Growth Loops closes the loop through Nutshell and RevenueCloudFX attribution. Closed-loop wiring into non-Nutshell systems is Platform work. Other vendors sell agents. Growth Loops runs TeamAI agents on FXBrain and the WebFX platform: industry knowledge, benchmarks, and specialist review already built in. 30+ years of work the AI learned from. Published WebFX figures from the revenue marketing platform Growth Loops runs on. Every number below is what the FXBrain compounds from. Built for 11 industries. Eleven, not fifty. We sell only where WebFX has enough campaign history for your specialist to already know your industry on day one, and enough of it for the FXBrain to be worth reading from. Outside the eleven, the WebFX Platform engagement is the honest fit. Healthcare / Medical Patient-data and claims-compliance scrutiny; compliance-aware paid execution. Banking / Insurance / Lending Regulated-industry scrutiny; education-led nurture for products buyers compare carefully. Manufacturing / Industrial Complex B2B sales cycles; CFO scrutiny on marketing spend; long consideration windows. Don’t see your industry? You may still be a fit through the WebFX Platform engagement. Talk to us → From strategy call to a fully operational revenue pipeline. Growth Loops starts with a strategy call, not a shopping cart. Once you sign, onboarding moves through an onboarding call, data integration, specialist assignment, and live intelligence. Onboarding call Your first post-sign session maps business strategy to the onboarding workflow ahead, so you leave knowing what happens first and who owns each step. Data integration You add WebFX as a manager on your Google Ads, paid social, and site. WebFX connects your tracking into RevenueCloudFX and your CRM, including Nutshell with 10 seats when you want your pipeline in one place. See integrations → Specialist assignment WebFX introduces your named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist as your accountable point of contact. They direct agents in TeamAI and meet with you on the cadence included with your plan. Scale adds the tier’s expanded sign-off standard. You always know who owns the account. Intelligence goes live Your CRM starts feeding FXClient Brain. Your industry intelligence is already loaded; your account intelligence begins compounding as your access comes online. Setup on pricing → Onboarding timing depends on how quickly access is granted. Setup, term, and onboarding details are spelled out on pricing. Upgrade to the WebFX Platform anytime. When you outgrow the set plans, the WebFX Platform engagement adds deeper data integration, predictive analytics, and a dedicated team. Nothing starts from zero. Honest expansion, not bait-and-switch. WebFX will tell you when you’ve outgrown us. Explore the WebFX Platform → What opens up Dedicated DataTech Architect wiring closed-loop revenue attribution into your CRM and sales systems 1,200+ built-in integrations maintained by WebFX AI search execution (the full OmniSEO program, not just diagnosis) Organic SEO, content production and link building Major CRO programs, ABM, and enterprise rollout support Upgrade mechanics Your FXClient Brain transfers in full Agent memory carries over Six-month price-lock at Growth Loops rates Nutshell seats scale with you Questions owners and marketing leads ask before signing. Can I stand behind the AI’s recommendations when someone asks? Yes. Every recommendation traces back to a pattern WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialists validated across real campaigns, and your Performance Strategist’s brief includes the rationale: which patterns informed the call, the predicted outcome range, and the backup plan. On Scale, a Revenue Marketing Specialist signs off on every recommendation before it ships, which is why teams under the heaviest scrutiny land there. Does Starter have the same accountability as Scale? Every tier runs the same managed model: TeamAI agents handle planning, research, and campaign development, while a named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist orchestrates the account all month, sets direction, and validates what gets shipped. Tiers do not change who is accountable. They step up the operating depth around that same leadership layer: channel scope, stack depth, scheduled talk time, and sign-off cadence. Every tier includes a Marketing Specialist. What’s the difference between Growth Loops and the WebFX Platform? Growth Loops is the published-price managed program: Google Ads on every plan, paid social and AdTechFX options on eligible tiers, always-on agents, lead attribution, FXBrain access, and a named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist. The WebFX Platform is the custom engagement when you need more: a dedicated data specialist who ties marketing spend to closed sales in your CRM, full organic SEO and content programs, major site conversion work, and 1,200+ integrations WebFX maintains. Scale is still Growth Loops, not Platform. You can upgrade anytime; your FXBrain and agent history carry over. What is the FXBrain? Three nested intelligence layers, cross-vertical (FXBrain), vertical (FXIndustry), and your account (FXClient), that every agent reads from on every decision. Curated by WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialists, not scraped from the internet. That validated work is what makes WebFX agents different from generic AI agents. Do I have to run Nutshell to get attribution? No. All plans include channel-level and multi-touch attribution on leads. For full revenue-stage attribution, adopt Nutshell using the 10 included Professional seats, or upgrade to the WebFX Platform for closed-loop attribution across any CRM with 1,200+ platforms. How quickly can we deploy? Your FXBrain and FXIndustry Brain are pre-loaded on Day 1, so your agent team starts with your industry already mapped. Your FXClient Brain starts compounding from Week 1, and by Week 8 it has accumulated enough of your account’s own results to visibly influence decisions. What happens to my FXClient Brain if I leave WebFX? It’s yours, fully portable. You take it with you. The upper layers (FXBrain and FXIndustry) collapse without the WebFX Platform they run on. That’s the part rebuilding elsewhere is impossible. Who is Growth Loops built for? Built for companies that want paid marketing managed with one named specialist accountable for the program. Marketing managers, owners, and VPs who already spend on paid are the core fit. Enterprise and regulated teams are welcome on Scale (or Platform when that is the honest fit). Every plan includes always-on agents plus a named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist. If you want a managed program with accountability, you are in the right place. Agent Garden is available when you want to extend beyond your plan. A fully managed paid program with named specialist accountability on every plan. Pick Starter, Growth, or Scale by workload (channels, platform scope, specialist cadence), not by company size alone. How does Growth Loops compare to a traditional marketing agency? Growth Loops is managed paid marketing: Google Ads including Local Service Ads where applicable, paid social and AdTechFX options on eligible tiers, with a named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist directing the program and TeamAI agents handling recurring planning, research, and campaign work. Buyers comparing an AI marketing agency to a traditional agency usually want accountable performance: a named WebFX Revenue Marketing Specialist who directs the program, always-on agents, and your account’s marketing memory (FXBrain) on every plan. Growth Loops delivers that as a published-price managed service (Starter, Growth, Scale) with 10 Nutshell Professional seats and channel-level lead attribution included on every plan. Organic SEO programs, local SEO retainers, and link building live in WebFX Platform scope when paid tiers are not enough. TeamAI is execution infrastructure behind the managed service, not a self-serve signup path for running your own agent workspace. Ready to put 30+ years of validated marketing intelligence to work? A strategy call to confirm whether Starter, Growth, or Scale fits. If Growth Loops is not the right fit, we will say so and point you to the WebFX Platform.",
