k more effectively. Goodcall, an AI-driven software for small businesses, used TikTok Ads to drive sign-ups for its free and premium services. By using creator-led content, Spark Ads, and audience targeting, they optimized conversions and reduced customer acquisition costs. CAC decreased by 96% 2K+ new accounts gained per month Woofz Woofz, a leading dog training app, tested TikTok's Smart+ App Campaign on iOS to drive subscriptions at a lower cost. By leveraging AI-powered automation, they optimized performance and increased conversions while minimizing acquisition costs. CPA decreased by 60% Conversions increased by 67% Grande Cosmetics Grande Cosmetics, the #1 Lash & Brow serum brand in the U.S., used TikTok Shop Ads to scale sales and discovery. With Video Shopping Ads and Spark Ads, they streamlined the purchase journey, grew organic success, and engaged affiliate to drive conversions. Achieved 10X ROAS CPA decreased 85% Good Protein Good Protein, a health and wellness brand, turned to TikTok to drive conversions and expand its customer base. By leveraging Spark Ads and Smart+ Web Campaigns, they optimized ad performance and engaged new audiences with compelling, creator-led content. CPA decreased by 18% ROAS increased by 28% 01 / 04 Brand Safety at TikTok Building a platform that is safe for brands first means building a platform that’s safe for every day users. Over the last year, TikTok has made great strides in developing partnerships that help promote and sustain a safe environment for all users on the TikTok platform. TikTok works with industry experts, non-governmental organizations, and industry associations around the world in our commitment to building a safe platform for our community. We collaborate with organizations in different regions to share best practices, create programs, and exchange ideas on safety-related topics. Whatever your goal, TikTok's got you covered Build a community and drive brand awareness Use TikTok to let your audience discover your brand's story and engage with your products. Nurture your community to be your brand advocates. Find new customers and increase online sales Reach your most engaged audience and share unique product features, customer reviews, coupons and offers to boost your online sales. Retarget and sell to existing customers Use custom audiences, to target your existing customers and showcase new products they might be interested in. Turn prospects into leads Identify and educate potential customers about your product/service by sharing an ebook/guide, run surveys, or generate registrations for product launches or events. 1 / 2 Build a community and drive brand awareness Use TikTok to let your audience discover your brand's story and engage with your products. Nurture your community to be your brand advocates. Find new customers and increase online sales Reach your most engaged audience and share unique product features, customer reviews, coupons and offers to boost your online sales. Retarget and sell to existing customers Use custom audiences, to target your existing customers and showcase new products they might be interested in. Turn prospects into leads Identify and educate potential customers about your product/service by sharing an ebook/guide, run surveys, or generate registrations for product launches or events. Launch an ad in minutes 1. Select your advertising objective. 2. Set your budget, targeting and bidding method. 3. Upload your video or photo, add your ad copy and CTA.",
