poser: Stage Scenes and Control Camera Angles Place characters and props in a 3D scene, adjust the virtual camera, and generate consistent AI video shots from multiple angles before spending credits. Topview for Teams Share Projects, Credits, and Assets Across the Team Give creators one place for team video collaboration while admins control credits and keep production materials organized. Built for enterprise marketing teams, agencies, and film or creative studios. Collaborate on Video Projects Team members can work from shared projects in Canvas, Drama Studio, and Board, with references and outputs kept in one place. Manage Team Credits Admins can share credits, monitor usage, and keep production spend under control across members and departments. Organize Every Generated Asset Videos, images, audio, avatars, references, and approved materials stay grouped, reviewed, and reusable. Six Ways to Create Films, Short Dramas, and Ads with AI Topview AI Video Agent is built for film creators, micro-drama teams, marketers, and ecommerce brands. Use it as an AI film generator, AI movie maker, AI short drama generator, AI marketing video generator, and AI ad video generator in one creative workspace. AI Film and Cinematic Video Production Turn a scene idea, script, or visual reference into cinematic shots with camera movement, lighting, mood, character direction, and editable story structure. Topview works as an AI film generator and AI movie maker for creators who want film-style video without a full production crew. Create a film scene AI Short Drama and Micro-Drama Creation Build short dramas, micro-dramas, vertical dramas, and episode-style story videos from a novel, script, or rough plot. The agent helps plan characters, scenes, props, prompts, continuity, and dialogue so Drama Studio can move from story to generated video faster. Create a short drama Reference Video Recreation Upload a reference video and let the AI Video Agent analyze the style, rhythm, shot structure, camera language, and hooks. Recreate the creative direction for your own film scene, short drama, product story, or campaign video. Clone a video style UGC-Style Ads Generate realistic UGC-style ads with lifelike AI presenters, natural hooks, creator-style pacing, and product storytelling. It is designed for teams testing AI ad videos across TikTok, Instagram, Meta, and other paid channels. Try AI UGC TikTok, Reels, and Shorts Content Batch-create short-form videos for TikTok, Reels, Shorts, and social campaigns from one idea or asset set. Keep brand voice consistent while testing hooks, captions, aspect ratios, edits, and platform-native video formats. Generate short videos URL to Marketing and Ad Video Paste a product URL or campaign brief and turn it into a polished marketing video, explainer, product ad, or comparison clip. Topview acts as an AI marketing video generator and AI ad video generator for commercial creative teams. Create ad videos From Single-Purpose Generators to an Agent Production System Most tools make one asset at a time. Topview is designed for the full creative loop: plan, generate, compare, refine, and adapt across video, image, social, and commercial formats. Creative Input Reference Video Recreation Image + Video Workflow Narrative Production Platform Formats Localization and Scale One Workspace, Many Creative Engines Topview routes creative work across video, image, avatar, voice, and localization capabilities so each task uses the model best suited to the output. Cinematic Motion and Scene Output Generate short films, drama scenes, social clips, product videos, and reference-led variations with strong motion, camera direction, and visual continuity. Visual Assets Before and After Video Create thumbnails, product imagery, character references, scene concepts, and image edits that can feed directly into video generation and campaign production. People, Dialogue, and Localization Add presenters, voiceover, captions, and 30+ language localization when a video needs explanation, performance, or market-specific versions. Specialized Tools When the Agent Needs Sharper Control Move from broad agent creation into focused tools for video generation, image creation, character swaps, upscaling, motion control, product photography, voiceover, and more. A Broader Production Surface for Modern Creative Teams Create films, drama scenes, social posts, image assets, product videos, and localized campaigns from one agent-driven creative system. Agent workspace for video planning, image creation, reference inputs, model choice, and final output. Major creation modes: films and dramas, video recreation, social content, ads, image assets, and API workflows. Languages for voiceover, captions, and localized creative variants when teams need global output. Production Teams Already Use Topview to Scale Output “TopView's AI Video Agent helped iLive by SHOPNOW grow our AI video production services revenue by 80%, while cutting labor and costs by 50%. It gives our team a faster way to test ideas, produce variations, and turn creative work into measurable output.” Long Ma CEO, Shopnow Technology JSC Revenue growth in AI video production services Labor and production cost reduction Faster turnaround on every video campaign",
