t, even with accents or unclear pronunciation, our video transcriber can still maintain high recognition accuracy. In most cases, Transcribe Video AI can reach over 98% accuracy. The transcribed text can also be translated into multiple languages, greatly improving efficiency for language learners and multilingual subtitle creation. Transcribe Video to Text for Free>> Generate Transcripts, Subtitles, and Summaries for Any Use Case Not only transcripts, the video to text converter also supports automatic subtitle generation with timestamps. It can also summarize the content, allowing you to quickly turn long videos into clear and structured summaries. It is useful for note-taking, meeting organization, or any other purpose. Convert Video to Text>> Convert Long Videos up to 1GB in Minutes Compared to many tools that require long queues or have video length limits, Transcribe Video AI can complete transcription much more efficiently. Even long TED talk videos can be processed within minutes. The whole process is fast and convenient, all you need to do is upload your video file, with no sign-up required. Try Video Transcription Now How it works Easy Steps to Transcribe Video to Text Online Transcribe video to text in just 3 steps: upload your file or paste a URL, click the button, and get your transcript in minutes. Download in your preferred format. 01 Upload your video Transcribe Video AI supports multiple video formats including MP4, MOV, and AVI, as well as YouTube links and other social media platforms. 02 Start transcribing video After uploading your video, whether it is a few minutes or several hours long, it will be processed within minutes. The whole process is fast, secure, and efficient. 03 Download & further summarize You can download your content or further summarize your video, generate a mind map, or translate it into other languages based on your needs. 12,000+ Happy Clients Hear from Loyal Users of Transcribe Video AI Previously, organizing meeting notes was really time-consuming and frustrating for me, but after using Transcribe Video AI to transcribe Zoom calls into text, everything became much easier. I can quickly extract key points and clearly identify speakers, which makes follow-ups much more efficient. Kevin Park Operations Specialist I transcribe video to text to improve my studying. Even when teachers have less standard pronunciation, Transcribe Video AI can still accurately recognize and transcribe the content. The whole process is fast, and it has become a helpful tool for me before exams. Emily Carter Student As a YouTuber, creating subtitles used to take a lot of time. With Transcribe Video AI, I can easily generate transcripts and subtitles, and also translate them into multiple languages. This has significantly improved my efficiency and allowed me to spend more time on content creation. Daniel Kim Video Creator Transcribe Video AI FAQs If you run into any issues while transcribing videos or have any feedback or suggestions, feel free to reach out to us via email.",
