    "content": "Most people overthink their first post. They wait for the perfect idea, the perfect words, the perfect moment. But the secret is: just start. Your first 10 posts won't be your best, and that's the whole point. Here's what actually works: 🌱 Write about what you're learning right now 📈 Share one small insight every day 🔄 Repurpose across platforms ✨ Let your voice develop naturally Consistency beats perfection. Every single time. The people with the biggest audiences didn't start with an audience. They started with a habit: write, publish, iterate. Your future self will thank you for starting today.",
