h pass/fail thresholds Timed quizzes with leaderboards Track individual and group performance Quiz: Company Policy Assessment Employees must report data breaches within 24 hours. Results Great job! You passed the compliance training. Your certificate has been sent to your email. Don't start from scratch Browse 300+ templates designed for real use cases. Pick one, make it yours, and publish. What's your skin type? Product Recommender E-Commerce What's your biggest marketing challenge? Lead Generation Quiz Marketing Our PTO policy allows rollover days. Employee Onboarding HR How easy was the checkout flow? What would you improve? UX Research Survey UX Which logo belongs to our brand? Brand Awareness Quiz Marketing Sharing passwords with coworkers is acceptable if urgent. Compliance Training HR How many leads do you generate monthly? ROI Calculator Business What type of content do you create? Content Strategy Quiz Creators Skip the blank canvas Or let AI build it for you with the AI Quiz Generator. Describe your quiz in one sentence, upload a PDF, paste a URL, or drop in an image. Our AI quiz generator writes the questions, options, and correct answers in seconds. Generate from a prompt, PDF, Word, PowerPoint, image, or URL Multiple choice, true/false, and short-answer formats Per-question regenerate: swap any question with one click Free forever plan, no credit card required Free forever plan · Built on Claude AI Free forever plan · Built on Claude AI Need a form, not a quiz? Generate a form from one prompt with the AI Form Generator. Describe what you need, upload a PDF brief, or paste a URL. Our AI form generator picks the right field types, adds validation, and builds a branded form ready to embed. Lead-gen, contact, registration, feedback, or intake forms 12 field types: email, phone, dropdown, checkbox, and more 23 native CRM and email integrations, plus Zapier and n8n Free forever plan, no credit card required Three steps. That's it. You'll be live before your coffee gets cold. Pick a template Choose from 300+ ready-made templates or start with a blank canvas. Either way, you're building in seconds. Drag, drop, done Add fields, set up logic, and style your design visually. Or let AI do it for you by describing what you need. You're live! Publish and share Get a link, embed on your site, or share directly. Responses flow in and analytics update in real-time. Your AI assistant Just tell it what you need. Every Uplup plan comes with a built-in AI assistant. Describe what you want in plain English and it handles fields, design, logic, analytics, everything. Like having a teammate who never sleeps. Build entire quizzes by describing them No more adding questions one by one. Just describe your quiz and watch it appear: questions, answer options, scoring, all of it. “Create a personality quiz that recommends products based on the user's answers.” Done! I've added 3 fields: Updated your theme: Warm palette applied. Buttons rounded to pill shape. Font set to Inter. Design without the design panel Describe your brand style in words. AI picks the colors, fonts, and button shapes. You can always tweak manually if you want. “Match our brand: coral and cream, clean and friendly.” Ask questions about your data Don't export to a spreadsheet. Just ask: where are people dropping off? What's the average score? Which question needs work? “Show me where people are dropping off.” Here's what I found: Big drop at Question 3. It might be too long. Try splitting it into two shorter questions. Who it's for Built for the way you actually work. Uplup has the scoring, logic, and integrations to power real workflows across every team. HR & Operations Applications, pulse surveys, requests Creators & Freelancers Payments, lead magnets, client intake Product & UX NPS, feature requests, user research Marketing & Growth Lead gen, events, campaign surveys Educators & Trainers Quizzes, evaluations, certifications E-commerce Order forms, product quizzes, payments Integrations Connect with your favorite tools. 23 native CRM and email integrations, with Zapier covering everything else. Plus an MCP server so Claude, ChatGPT, and Cursor can build forms and read submissions for you. Every submission syncs automatically. See all integrations Loved by 10,000+ creators Don't take our word for it. Here's what they say. Kimberly D. ShopWithMeMama.com “I love that Uplup is customizable and I can add my own branding. The ease of use and quick customer service are amazing. I collect valuable feedback through quizzes and forms, and Uplup has been incredibly helpful!” Laura Sproull RaiseYourGarden.com “Thrilled to use Uplup for engaging my audience. My website runs dozens of interactive quizzes yearly, and Uplup easily collects emails. Super easy to use!” Brandon Cumberledge US “I have been using Uplup for the past two months and I could not be more pleased. Any requests put in have been answered immediately. The new features have done wonders and will continue using their service for a very long time.” Natalia Teacher, UA “The customer support assistant helped to figure out how to register my account. Love this site! Thanks! I recommend this website!” Quick answers The things people ask before their first quiz. What is Uplup? Uplup is a quiz maker built for lead generation. You create personality quizzes, trivia, and graded assessments with drag and drop or AI, put an email gate in front of the results, and every lead arrives with their answers attached. Forms and surveys are built in too. Is Uplup really free? Yes. The Free plan is free forever: 50 responses a month, unlimited quizzes and questions, every question type, and all four scoring modes. No credit card to sign up. Can AI build my quiz for me? Yes. Describe the quiz in a sentence, or hand the AI a PDF, URL, image, or document, and it writes the questions, answers, and explanations. You edit anything you like before publishing. Does Uplup do forms and surveys too? Yes. The same builder makes contact forms, registrations, feedback surveys, and payment forms with 43+ field types, so one subscription covers what would usually take a quiz tool plus a form tool. How is Uplup different from other quiz makers? Most quiz tools meter the thing you care about: leads, completions, or quizzes. Uplup gives you unlimited quizzes on every plan and pools responses account-wide. We also publish fact-checked comparisons against the tools we compete with, live pricing included, so you can check our math. Free tools, no account needed Quick picks for raffles, team events, and everyday decisions. Built on the same fair, verifiable selection engine as the rest of Uplup.",
