nsure the right people have the right level of access. Control how AI accesses, processes and protects your research. Every insight links back to supporting evidence. Responsible safeguards help protect participants. Maintain a complete audit trail across every study. Review Juno's live security, compliance, and governance controls. Visit the Trust Centre → $45 per completed interview. Study design is free. Pay when Juno does the research. Buy interviews whenever you need them. No subscription, no minimum spend. Try Juno free Running complex or regular research? Custom commercial models are available. Get custom pricing → Juno works best for teams that need real customer answers but do not want to run a research platform. Tell Juno what you need to decide; Juno shapes the study plan, interviews the right people and prepares the report. Customer, brand, product, concept, pricing, churn and experience questions where the why matters. Juno is strongest when you need interviews, follow-ups and answers with quotes behind them. Bring your own list, use your own panel provider, or ask Juno to recruit from a global panel of 30 million people — both options work within the same study, and panel availability varies by market and target profile. Juno supports standard demographic and behavioural screening, manages participant incentives, and typically reaches qualitative saturation with smaller samples. Your Juno contact can confirm screening options, incentive details and appropriate sample sizes at briefing. Yes. Juno can show images, video, moodboards, concepts, ads, product pages, prototypes and other study material, then ask neutral questions around what people notice, believe and question. Juno follows useful threads, brings the interview back on track when it drifts, and flags thin, contradictory or unusable answers rather than forcing them into the story. Juno checks questions as it goes, avoids leading language, links answers to transcripts and interview moments, and 