    "source": "https://walterwrites.ai/",
    "content": "Walter is the AI authenticity platform. Rewrite AI drafts into natural, human writing, and detect AI-generated text, images, and deepfakes. So you always know what’s authentic, and what you publish is unmistakably yours. Built for content teams, marketers, and writers. Whether you're a content team, an SEO agency, a marketer, or a professional writer, Walter turns AI drafts into writing that carries your voice, clear, natural, and authentically yours. Walter turns flat, robotic AI drafts into reader-first copy that resonates, supporting the E-E-A-T signals search engines reward while reducing the risk of AI-content penalties. Business & Email Fix robotic AI tone fast Whether you’re sending outreach emails, internal updates, executive summaries, or client proposals, Walter helps you sound clear, confident, and real. It rephrases AI-generated content to match your tone and intent so your words land with the trust, polish, and personality they need across every business touchpoint. Educators & Teachers Detect AI in lessons easily Walter helps educators turn stiff, AI written teaching content into natural, engaging lessons and gives them a built in AI checker to scan essays, assignments and student papers for AI signals. Legal Professionals Polished, on-voice legal drafts Walter refines AI-generated contracts, briefs, and legal documents into clear, authentic text that preserves your voice and reads naturally, while keeping your meaning precise. Turn ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini Drafts into Writing That Sounds Like You Instantly transform AI-generated drafts into natural, human-sounding text that carries your voice. Walter’s rewriting tool refines drafts from ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini to improve fluency, tone, and sentence structure so your content sounds authentic and reads naturally. Ideal for essays, research papers, articles, and professional documents, Walter preserves your original intent in over 80 languages. Free AI Detector for Essays, Articles, and Professional Writing Walter’s AI Detector instantly analyzes your text to identify AI-generated patterns, while our humanizer refines drafts so they read naturally and authentically. Whether you’re a marketer, content team, or professional writer, Walter helps you publish writing that’s unmistakably yours. Original, Human-Like Writing You Can Publish With Confidence Keep Your Writing Original, Natural, and Authentically Yours Machine-generated content often reads flat because of repetitive patterns and unnatural phrasing. Walter refines drafts at the structure and tone level so your writing stays original, natural-sounding, and true to your voice across essays, articles, and professional documents. Everything you need to know about Walter AI and how it can help you create Human-like AI content. What tools does Walter Writes AI offer? Walter offers two core tools: an AI Humanizer that rewrites AI-generated text to sound natural and authentically human, and an AI Detector that scans content to estimate AI-likelihood. Both are available in one workspace at walterwrites.ai. Is Walter Writes AI free to use? You can start with a free 300-word trial. When you are ready for more, choose a paid plan that fits your volume and features. You can change or cancel anytime. Does Walter integrate with Claude, ChatGPT, or other tools? Yes. Walter has a free MCP connector for Claude that brings humanization and detection into your Claude conversation. Free GPTs for humanize and detect are also available on ChatGPT. For developers, the Walter AI Humanizer API offers programmatic access to all engines. What languages does Walter Writes AI support? Walter supports over 80 languages, so users can humanize and detect AI-generated content in their native language regardless of where they are writing from. What is the difference between the AI Humanizer and the AI Detector? The AI Humanizer rewrites AI-generated text to sound natural and human, so it reads naturally and reflects your voice. The AI Detector scans text and estimates how likely it is to be flagged as AI-written. Both tools work together in Walter's workspace: humanize first, then check your score. Can Walter be used by teams? Yes. Walter's Teams plan supports up to 10 members with a shared pool of 500,000 words per month. It includes top-up words, advanced humanization, and built-in AI detection for the whole team. Is the AI Humanizer API available? Yes. The Walter AI Humanizer API is live with six published pricing tiers from $49 per month (300K words) up to $1,699 per month (25M words), plus custom enterprise pricing above that. See the AI Humanizer API page for full pricing, code samples, and docs. Do you integrate with other AI detectors? Walter uses its own built-in detector to estimate AI likelihood. We are not affiliated with other detection services. What tools does Walter Writes AI offer? Walter offers two core tools: an AI Humanizer that rewrites AI-generated text to sound natural and authentically human, and an AI Detector that scans content to estimate AI-likelihood. Both are available in one workspace at walterwrites.ai. What is the difference between the AI Humanizer and the AI Detector? The AI Humanizer rewrites AI-generated text to sound natural and human, so it reads naturally and reflects your voice. The AI Detector scans text and estimates how likely it is to be flagged as AI-written. Both tools work together in Walter's workspace: humanize first, then check your score. Is Walter Writes AI free to use? You can start with a free 300-word trial. When you are ready for more, choose a paid plan that fits your volume and features. You can change or cancel anytime. Can Walter be used by teams? Yes. Walter's Teams plan supports up to 10 members with a shared pool of 500,000 words per month. It includes top-up words, advanced humanization, and built-in AI detection for the whole team. Does Walter integrate with Claude, ChatGPT, or other tools? Yes. Walter has a free MCP connector for Claude that brings humanization and detection into your Claude conversation. Free GPTs for humanize and detect are also available on ChatGPT. For developers, the Walter AI Humanizer API offers programmatic access to all engines. Is the AI Humanizer API available? Yes. The Walter AI Humanizer API is live with six published pricing tiers from $49 per month (300K words) up to $1,699 per month (25M words), plus custom enterprise pricing above that. See the AI Humanizer API page for full pricing, code samples, and docs. What languages does Walter Writes AI support? Walter supports over 80 languages, so users can humanize and detect AI-generated content in their native language regardless of where they are writing from. Do you integrate with other AI detectors? Walter uses its own built-in detector to estimate AI likelihood. We are not affiliated with other detection services. Latest Research & Insights on AI Detection, Humanization, and Content Authenticity Explore expert-written guides and evidence-based research on AI-generated content, detection tools, and advanced humanization techniques. Stay informed on how artificial intelligence is shaping detection, authorship standards, and content authenticity.",
