    "content": "AI Video Clipper. Turn Long Videos into Share-Ready Shorts WayinVideo's AI clip maker auto-detects highlights, speaker changes, and pacing to turn any long video into short, share-ready clips. Generate vertical Shorts in one click for YouTube, TikTok, Instagram Reels, and more. AI Video Search. Find Any Moment in Your Video WayinVideo's AI video finder analyzes your full video and transcript so you can type a keyword or question and instantly jump to the exact moment you need. Stop scrubbing the timeline and let AI surface the right clips for you. AI Video Summarizer. Understand Any Video in Seconds Get a one-paragraph overview plus a timestamped outline of key moments so you can scan any long video in seconds. WayinVideo's AI video summarizer supports 100+ languages, making cross-language learning effortless. AI Video Transcription. Timestamped & Speaker Labeled Produce accurate AI video transcripts with punctuation, timestamps, and speaker labels that you can copy straight into your notes, documents, or workflows. Use WayinVideo's video-to-text transcription with free daily credits for meetings, classes, and interviews. AI Caption Generator. Animated Subtitles in Any Language WayinVideo automatically creates multilingual subtitles, applies animated caption styles and callout cards, and exports videos ready for social in one click. Use AI captions to keep viewers engaged on TikTok, Reels, Shorts, and more. AI Video Reframe. One Edit, Every Aspect Ratio WayinVideo's AI video reframe tracks faces and key objects to keep your subject perfectly centered in 9:16, 1:1, or 16:9. Resize videos for TikTok, Reels, Shorts, Stories, and YouTube automatically from a single edit. API Integration: Build Anything on Top of WayinVideo Connect WayinVideo's full capabilities to your automation workflow. You can trigger via API to better your production. Process videos programmatically without ever opening a browser. Access features fast: AI clipping, transcription, summarization and find moments — all available through WayinVideo API.",
