per prompt. This coverage reflects how your brand appears across the answer engines driving the majority of AI search traffic today. When Wellows tells you your citation footprint is shifting, you’re seeing the full picture, not a partial slice. Can I use Wellows across multiple brands or regions? Yes. Wellows is built for multi-brand and multi-region tracking, which is why agencies and enterprise teams adopt it. Each project tracks one brand and domain with its own competitors, topics, tracked prompts, and LLMs. Competitor lists can be managed independently per country (US, Canada, UK, New Zealand, and more). One seat gives your team a multi-project switcher to move between clients or sibling brands, with shared dashboards and team collaboration built in. Citation data, Content Opportunities, and Outreach Opportunities all stay scoped to the right project, so regional and brand-level insights never get mixed. How is an AI visibility platform different from traditional SEO tools? Traditional SEO tools track keyword rankings, backlinks, and crawl depth on web search engines. An AI visibility platform like Wellows tracks how AI answer engines cite, mention, and frame your brand in generated responses. It is a different layer with different rules. There is no page two in AI search: your brand is in the answer or it isn’t. Wellows doesn’t replace Semrush or Ahrefs; it works alongside them in the AI search layer. The closest analogy is backlinks. LLM Citations are the leading indicator for AI visibility the same way backlinks were for Google rankings. The difference is that the citation graph includes forum threads, reviews, and source URLs, not just hyperlinks. Get cited Start getting citedin AI search. See where your brand stands in AI search and take action to get cited more. Get a 90-day customized AI visibility plan.",
