    "content": "Do your courses take weeks or months to build? \t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\tWant to cut course development costs? \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\tDon’t have the resources for custom course development?\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\tTry It for Free\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t AI Course Creator empowers you to build custom, interactive online courses that are ready to deliver in a fraction of the time. Save time, money and effort with our affordable AI course generator. \r\n\r\n                \r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                        $\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                \r\n\r\n             \r\n\r\n             From idea to interactive courses in minutes – now officially recognised as one of the best AI-powered course builders in EdTech. eSkilled AI Course Creator generates complete, ready-to-deliver courses from start to finish. In one seamless workflow, AI builds structured lessons, interactive activities, and rich multimedia that bring learning to life. Each course can include images, videos, infographics, diagrams, visual explanations, flip cards, quizzes, and scenario-based learning — all organized into a cohesive course you can launch immediately. No manual assembly. No switching between tools. Just a fully built course, ready to use. 5.0 Based on 26 reviews powered by Google eSkilled’s Course AI generates high quality, ready-to-deliver courses in just minutes. Curriculum Architecture: The Course AI engine architects the learning journey first — mapping outcomes, structuring learning flows, and scaffolding complexity before content is written, ensuring courses are logically sequenced, outcome-aligned, and competency-driven. Visual Scaffolding: Intelligently integrates contextual imagery throughout the learning experience using our cloud-based e-learning software to reinforce understanding, reduce cognitive load, and improve knowledge retention. Smart Scaffolding: Dynamically builds complexity using proven adult learning models within the elearning creation software. Each subtopic is dynamically built using specialised instructional archetypes that deliberately develop reasoning, problem-solving and decision-making. Pedagogically Engineered Quizzes: Tests real-world application using our AI-powered course maker to ensure genuine learning transfer, not rote recall. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSee how organisations are transforming course development with eSkilled AI Course Creator. From building hundreds of training units in months to reducing development timelines from over a year to just 30 days, these customer success stories showcase the impact of modern course creation software in accelerating content production and scaling training delivery. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t Leith Darrach, Director of Academy of NT Technical Skills, explains how eSkilled AI Course Creator took his business from an “uphill battle” to a streamlined success story. Kathy McKenzie — Founder & Lead Coach at FIREUP Coaching and Master Certified Coach, shares how eSkilled AI Course Creator transformed their course development process. Kathy McKenzie from Australian RTO, FIREUP Coaching, shares how eSkilled AI Course Creator helped simplify their entire suite of apps. Leith Darrach (Director of the Academy of NT Technical Skills) explains how he secured audit-ready RTO resources by leveraging the eSkilled AI Course Creator. eSkilled AI Course Creator builds you ready to deliver courses, complete with imagery, diagrams, interactive elements \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur AI Course Creator platform automates the creation of course outlines, lesson plans, and learning materials based on your input, eliminating time-consuming manual tasks and making course design more efficient.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEnrich your courses with our AI Course Creator’s interactive features, such as quizzes, simulations, and multimedia. Captivate your learners and reinforce their understanding with lively learning aids like image hotspots and flip cards.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUse our AI Course Generator’s real-time analytics to track learner progress and performance. Pinpoint areas for improvement, refine your course content, and make informed decisions to elevate the learner experience.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGenerate unique imagery to enhance your course materials, plus save money on commercial licensing for stock imagery!\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFor flexible, on-the-go learning. AI Course Creator adapts perfectly to desktop, tablet, and mobile phone.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t Enhance the learning experience and improve accessibility for ESL students or those with visual impairment. Choose from a range of narration voices. Course Theme Templates: Apply pre-built themes for a professional look instantly. Syllabus & Curriculum Generator: Automatically outline and structure your courses using our course creation tools. Document Conversion: Transform existing manuals and PDFs into interactive modules. AI Case Study Generation: Our course AI instantly creates realistic, contextualized case studies tailored to your learners. AI Generated Quizzes: Build interactive assessments in seconds to measure learner understanding with our course creation platform. AI Image Generation: Produce on-brand visuals for your courses without stock fees. AI Text to Speech Narration: Generate natural-sounding voiceovers in multiple languages. Interactive Activities: Add drag-and-drop, branching, and other engaging learning interactions. Contextualization: Adapt generic content to your organization’s policies, branding, and scenarios. 90+ Languages: Deliver global training with automatic translation, enhanced by AI course generation. SCORM e-Learning Authoring Software: Export courses in SCORM format for seamless LMS integration using our elearning content software. Data Security: Keep your IP and learner data safe with enterprise-grade protection. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur versatile course creation software is designed for anyone looking to create courses with AI without the traditional technical hurdles or high development costs. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t Anyone who wants to create a course with AI! Content Creators e-Learning Developers HR Professionals Learning & Development Teams Teachers & Educators \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWhether you need a simple course maker or a comprehensive AI course generator, our elearning creation software scales to meet the specific training demands of your industry and role. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t With eBot, your clever AI Assistant, you can easily expand, summarize or bullet point certain sections, and enhance your courses directly in the elearning creation software by easily adding: AI-generated quizzes with multiple question formats AI-generated practical examples AI-generated document examples AI-generated case studies \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tExperience the next generation of e-learning authoring software and transform your training delivery with our powerful, all-in-one AI content generation tool. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t Expand your reach to non-English speakers and better support ESL students with our course creation software, allowing learners to choose their preferred training language. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEnsure elements like spelling, currency and practical examples are relevant to your learners. Contextualize with cultural, social, economic, political, legal, regulatory, environmental and regional considerations. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tChoose from a variety of pre-designed course templates which you can modify or create your own using our cloud-based elearning software, to align with your organization’s branding. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\teSkilled AI Course Creation Software makes sharing your courses with learners easy through these methods: \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\tEmbed onto any webpage using an iframe HTML code \t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\tShare courses to your learning management system via LTI (learning tool interoperability) \t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\tShare the course URL directly with students \t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\tDownload a SCORM file and import to your learning management system (LMS). \t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFree AI tools often share and reuse your data, posing risks for sensitive company IP. Our AI-powered online course generator is built on a version of ChatGPT that keeps your data confidential and secure. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\teSkilled’s AI course generator ensures consistent quality and depth throughout all content sections. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUnlike general AI content generation platforms, AI Course Creator consistently follows complex instructions without needing repeated prompts. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFree AI tools often require substantial trial and error, and detailed prompts to achieve desired results. AI Course Creator eliminates this hassle, providing a turn-key solution ready for immediate quality training delivery. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe course authoring software creates ready to deliver, interactive, hosted courses that are easily shared. It converts courses into SCORM format for LMS compatibility, features an intuitive drag-and-drop builder, and allows for custom branding, ensuring your courses are ready for seamless delivery.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\teSkilled’s course creation software is designed to follow the Tell-Show-Do format, for a strategic, scaffolded approach to learning.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t Enquire About AI Course Creator eSkilled stands out as the ultimate solution to create elearning course content tailored to your unique requirements. Our state-of-the-art technology and intuitive interface simplify the entire training lifecycle: Best AI Course Creator: Access the industry's most advanced AI for course creation to design engaging, effective modules in minutes. Comprehensive Tools: Our platform serves as a complete course creation tools hub, guaranteeing everything you need to build high-impact learning. Professional Output: Use the best elearning authoring software features to ensure your training meets the highest pedagogical standards. Tailored Solutions: Our extensive features ensure that elearning content creation is simple, scalable, and perfectly aligned with your brand.  What is eSkilled AI Course Creator?  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\teSkilled AI Course Creator is an AI-powered course builder that helps educators, instructional designers, and training organisations create high-quality online courses in minutes instead of days or weeks. It transforms your existing documents, presentations, or ideas into engaging eLearning courses complete with learning objectives, quizzes, assessments, interactive activities, and AI-generated imagery. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t  How does eSkilled AI Course Creator work?  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\teSkilled AI Course Creator uses artificial intelligence to transform your documents, presentations, or ideas into structured online courses. Upload Word documents, PDFs, PowerPoint presentations, or training materials, and the platform automatically generates lessons, learning objectives, quizzes, and multimedia content—saving hours of manual course development. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t  Can AI create a complete online course?   \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes. eSkilled AI Course Creator can generate complete online courses, including lesson content, learning objectives, quizzes, assessments, AI-generated images, and interactive learning activities.  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t  Can eSkilled AI Course Creator convert existing documents into interactive online courses?   \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes. It can convert Word documents, PDFs, PowerPoint presentations, learner guides, SOPs, and other training materials into interactive online courses.  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t  Can eSkilled AI Course Creator generate quizzes, assessments and learning activities?   \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes. The platform automatically generates quizzes, assessments, case studies, knowledge checks, and interactive learning activities based on your content. You can edit every question or regenerate new ones to match your learning objectives and training requirements. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t  Can I edit the course after the AI creates it?   \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAbsolutely. Every course created with eSkilled AI Course Creator is fully editable. You can update text, images, learning objectives, quizzes, assessments, multimedia, and course structure at any time, giving you complete control over the final learning experience.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t  Will eSkilled AI Course Creator work with my LMS?   \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes. It exports SCORM-compliant courses that work with most learning management systems (LMSs), including Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard, TalentLMS, and other SCORM-compatible platforms. This makes it easy to publish and deliver AI-generated courses using your existing LMS.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t  Is my data secure? Is my content used to train AI?   \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYour content remains your intellectual property. Training materials uploaded to eSkilled AI Course Creator are not used to train public AI models. We follow industry-standard security practices to help protect your data while giving you full control over your content.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t  Can AI create high-quality training courses?   \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes. AI can significantly reduce course development time while producing well-structured learning content. eSkilled AI Course Creator generates courses that instructional designers, educators, and subject matter experts can review, customize, and enhance to ensure they meet their quality and learning standards.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t  Is eSkilled AI Course Creator better than ChatGPT for creating online courses?   \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWhile ChatGPT is designed for general AI conversations, eSkilled AI Course Creator is built specifically for online course development. It understands the structure of effective learning experiences, helping you create engaging eLearning courses faster while reducing the time spent organising, designing, and building course content from scratch.",
