uring the project remains vendor-neutral, community-governed, and open for the long term. Learn about AAIF → Community An active community of developers, contributors, and users building extensions, sharing recipes, and pushing the boundaries of what local AI agents can do. Get started Available for macOS, Linux, and Windows curl -fsSL https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/releases/download/stable/download_cli.sh | bash",
